<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">41 - 24-02-22 Sala Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">MATEYO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe Mubotu wa Jesu Kilisitu Wakalembwa a Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Mubotu wa Jesu Kilisitu Wakalembwa a</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEYO</para>
  <para style="is">Bupanduluzhi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe kwendelana a Mateyo ndi bbuku limwe lili akati kama bbuku ali one amuchizuminano chipya, amba pabumi bwa Jesu Kilistu. Lyomwe lyangayo lilaitwa ati, “Mulumbe” chamba ati, “Makani Mabotu” a kalembwe chindi Jesu nakamana kufa, Mateyo, Maako, Luuka alimwi a Joni. Amana balembi tabazhi buzuba bwine a chindi mulumbe wa Mateyo niwakalembwa, pesi mpashi chakalinga chindi myaka ikkumi a chisambomwe kuzwa Jesu nakamana kuzhalwa. Alimwi a kubusena nkulyakalembelwa takuzhibikilwe kabotu. Pesi bantu banji balayezha yezha kwamba lyakalembwa mubusena bwa Palastini alimwi a mumuzhi wa Jelusalema. Alimwi mulembe Mateyo wakalinga shimutelo chindi Jesu katana kumulomba kwamba abe shichiya wakwe. Alimwi wakali kwitwa ati Levi. Mateyo wakalinga antomwi abatumwa balinga kkumi abobilo, bakalembela bamasololi ba ku Juuda. Ichi chilabonwa chatangalala akwelanizhingwa a chindi myaka ili kkumi a chisambomwe kuzwa mumalembe achizuminano chipya. Wakachichita kwamba atondezha bantu ati Jesu ngu Mesiya. Munununi usalilwe a Jesu wakashishimwa. Mateyo wakalemba zhintu zhinji kujatikizha bulelo bwa Leza. Bama Juuda bakalikuyeya kwamba Mesiya ulakuba Mwami wa tunzanyu mubulelo bwakwe. Pesi Mateyo wakabweza kuyandishisha kujaya muzezo ngubakalikuchite bama Juuda a kubazubulwila kwamba bwami bwa Leza mbwa Muuya. Mulumbe wa Mateyo, ndibbuku libotu lyelele kutalika makani mu chizuminano chipya ankambo kakwelanizhingwa nkulichite kuzwa ku chizuminano chakaindi. Lilaswanganya zhizuminano zhobilo. Balembe bamwi bakayeya kwamba Mateyo wakali kusola kuchilila bulembe bwa Mozesi, ayo ngu mabbuku ali osanwe akutanguna muchizuminano chipya. Mulumbe wa Jesu amulundu (5-7) inga lya elanizhigwa a chindi Jesu nakalikupa milawo kuli Mozesi muli bbuku lya Detulonomi 19.3-23-33 mbwakayalwa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mateyo wakautalika Mulumbe akupandulula kuzhalwa kwa Jesu Kilistu alimwi akutalika mulimo wakwe chinene cha 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Alimwi Mateyo wakatolelela a kupandulula mulimo wa Jesu alimwi akuishya kwakwe kunji muchinene cha 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mukumanizha, Mateyo wakamba palufu lwa Jesu, mulimo wakwe alimwi abubuke muchinene cha 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Mazhalane a Jesu Kilisitu Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luuka 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Aya ngumazhalane a Jesu Mesiya, Mwana Devedi a mwana a Ablahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abulahamu wakazhala Izeki, Izeki wakazhala Jakobe, Jakobe wakazhala Juuda alimwi a bamakwabo. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Juuda wakazhala Pelezi a Zela, muli Tama, Pelezi wakazhala Eziloni, Eziloni wakazhala Lamu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lamu wakazhala Aminadabu, Aminadabu wakazhala Nashoni, Nashoni wakazhala Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salimoni wakazhala Bowazi muli Lahabu, Bowazi wakazhala Obedi Muli Luute, Obedi wakazhala Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />alimwi Jessi wakazhala Mwami Devedi. Devedi wakazhala Solomoni, banyina bakalinga bamuka Uliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomoni wakazhala Leoboamu wakazhala Abija, Abija wakazhala Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa wakazhala Joeoshifati, Joeoshifati wakazhala Jeholamu, Jeholamu wakazhala Uzziya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzziya wakazhala Jotamu, Jotamu wakazhala Ahazi, Ahazi wakazhala Hezekiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hezekiya wakazhala Manase, Manase wakazhala Amoni, Amoni wakazhala Josiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Josiya wakazhala Jokoniya abamakwabo mu chiindi chabuzhike ku Babiloni.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ono nibakatolwa buzhike ku Babiloni Jokoniya wakazhala Shatelo, Shatelo wakazhala Zelubabelo. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zelubabelo wakazhala Abuyudi, Abuyudi wakazhala Eliyakimu, Eliyakimu wakazhala Azolo. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azolo wakazhala Zadoki, Zadoki wakazhala Akimu, Akimu wakazhala Eludi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eludi wakazhala Eliyeza, Eliyeza wakazhala Mattani, Mattani wakazhala Jakobe. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Alimwi Jakobe wakazhala Josefa muka Maliya, Maliya banyina Jesu witwa ati Mesiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Nkukwamba Mazhalane kuzwa kuli Devedi kushikila kuli Ablahamu akalinga makkumi one, makkumi one kuzwa ku chiindi cha Devedi a kushikila ku chiindi nchibakatolwa mubuzhike mu Babiloni, Alimwi makkumi one kushikila kukuzhalwa kwa Mesiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzhalwa kwa Jesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luuka 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ono mboobu Jesu Kilisitu mbwakazhalwa. Maliya Banyina Jesu bakalikukobekelwe kuli Josefa, pesi kabatana kuswagana wakajanika Ulimitile kwiinda mu Muuya Usalala. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Nkambo Josefa musakwa wakwe wakalinga Muntu wakali kushomeka, Taaku nakayanda kumuuvisha isoni, pesi wakalikuzhi kwaamba Ulakumuleka chakaumuumu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Pesi kachiyeya chakuchita Mungele wa Mwami wakabonekela muchiloto waamba, “Josefa Mwana Devedi, Utatiji Maliya kuba mukaintu wako nkambo nchamitile chakazwa ku Muuya Usalala. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ulakuzhala Mwaana musankwa, alimwi ulakumulika liina lya Jesu, nkambo ulakufutula bantu kuzwa kuzhibibi zhabo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Izhi zhoonse zhaka chitika kuzuzikizha Mwami nzhaakamba kwiinda mushinshimi wakwe ati, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />“Nakalindu ulakumita akuzhala mwaana musankwa, alimwi ulakwitwa liina lya kwaamba ati, Imaniwelo” (Chaamba ati, “Leza uli andiswe.”)<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Josefa nakabuka wakachita mbuli mungele wa Mwami mbwakamwaabila, amane wakabweza Maliya mukaintu wakwe wamutola ku ng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Pesi bakakkala kwakubula kuswangana anguwe kushikila nakazhala mwaana musankwa. Ngwakaulika liina lya kwaamba ati Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Basongo ba kujwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Jesu nakamana kuzhalwa mu chishi cha Betelehemu mu Judiya, mu chiindi cha Mwami Helondi. Kwakazwa basongo ba kujwe bakaza ku Jelusalemu bakabuzha ati, <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />“Nguli Mwaana wakazhalwa Mwami wama Juuda? Twaibona nyenyenzhi yakwe kaiza kuzwa kujwe twaza mukumukomba.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Abobo Mwami Helodi nakava wakapezhengwa, abantu boonse mu Jelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ono nakabaita boonse bapaizhi banene aba maii ba milawo wakababuzha ati, “Nkuli nkwayelele kuzhalilwa Mesiya?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bakanviila ati, “Mu Betelehemu mu munzhi wa Judiya,” “Nkambo nchichilembelwe a mushinshimi ati,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />‘Betelehemu munzhi wa Judiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">tooshi munzhi ushoonto a minzhi ya Judiya isololela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">muli ndiwe mulakuzwa musololi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">ushi akaendelezhe bantu bangu ba Izilaili.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ono Helodi wakaita beenzu bakazwa kujwe, ku muswangano wamaseseke kubuzha chiindi nyenyenzhi niyakaboneka. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Wakabatuma ku Betelehemu amalailile, Kamunka mukalange kabotu mwaana alimwi mwakumujana mukangambile andime nkaunke mukumukomba.<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Nakamana kunva bakaunka, alimwi nyenyenzhi yakaboneka kujwe kumpela kwabo, yakabasololela kushikila abusena akalinga mwaana yakaimikana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Nibakaibona nyenyenzhi bakakomana. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Nibakanjila Mu ng'anda bakabona mwaana kali a Maliya banyina, bakafugama akumupaila. Bamane bakajalula zhipego zhabo zha ngolide, atunukilizho a Malla akumupa.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Mbuli mbubakabachenjezha muchiloto kwaamba batakajokeli kuli Helodi, bakasebenzhe nzhila imbi kujokela ku chishi chabo.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbubakabalikila ku Igipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Nibakaunka, mungele wa Mwami wakaza muchiloto kuli Josefa waamba, “Buka bweza mwanaako abanyina muunke ku Igipiti, “Helodi ulalangaula mwaana ulanda kumujaya. Uunke ukakkale uko kushikila nka kwaambile ati zwako.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Josefa wakabuka akubweza mwaana a banyina bakatalika kuunka mashiku ku Igipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Uko nkwakakkala kushikila Helodi wafa. Alimwi chakazuzizhigwa icho nchakaamba Mwami kwiinda mu mushishimi wakwe ati, “Kuzwa mu Igipiti ndakaita mwanaangu musankwa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baana mbubakajaigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Helodi nakazhiba kwaamba basongo bakujwe bamuchenga, wakakalala maningi, wakapa malailile akujaya bana basankwa boonse mu Betelehemu aminzhi yoonse yakalinga kufafi ichite bana bamyaaka yobilo kuza anshi. Zhoonse zhachitika kwendelana ambubakamwambila ku basongo bakujwe, chiindi nyenyenzi niyakaboneka.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Munzhila iyi mushishimi Jelemiya nchakaamba chakazuzikizhigwa,<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />“Ijwi lyakanvika mu Lama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Kulila kuchisa kwakanvigwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Lakelo utekulila bana bakwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Wakaka kumbulizhigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">nkambo balifile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujokela kuzwa ku Igipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ono Helodi nakafa, mungele wa Leza wakaboneka muchiloto kuli Josefa mu Ijipiti kaamba ati, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />“Nyamuka, bweza mwanaako a banyina, kamuzhokela ku Izilaili, nkambo bakalinga kuyanda kumujaya mwaana bakafa. <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Josefa wakanyamuka akubweza Mwaana a banyina, akuzhokela ku Izilaili.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Pesi nakanva kwaamba Akelausi wakalinga kwendelezha mu Judiya a bwami bwa baishi ba Helodi, wakatija kujokela nakamana kuchenjezhegwa muchiloto, walo amane wakaunka mu chishi cha Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />alimwi wakaunka akukkala mu chishi cha Nazaleti. Ichi cha kazuzikizhigwa chakaamba bashinshimiati, “Ulakwiitwa muna Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Ku kambauka kwa Joni Mubbizhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maako 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luuka 3.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mu mazuba ayo Joni mubbizhi wakaza mulukula lwa Judiya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />wakalinga kukambauka ati, “Amusanduke nkambo bwami bwa ku julu buli afaafi!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Uyo ngu oyo ngubakalinga kwaamba kwiinda mu mushishimi Izaya nakaamba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Umwi uloongolola mulukula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Amubambe nzhila ya Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">akuilulamika nzhila yakwe!’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Zhisani zha Joni zhakabambwa abooya bwankamela, muchibuno wakalinga kwaanga mukopo wachipaya. Alimwi chakulya chakwe chakalinga nsozhi a buuchi bwamushokwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bantu bakaunka kuli nguwe kuzwa ku Jelusalema aku Judiya anyika yoonse ya Jodani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Kabalyambilila zhinyonyono zhabo amane wakalikubabbizha mu mulonga wa Jodani <verse eid="MAT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Pesi ono Joni nakabona ba mafalisi baanji aba Saduki kabaza mukubbizhigwa kuli nguwe, wakaamba kuli mbabo, “Imwe nonzoka nguni wamwabila kubalika kubukali mbwa Leza butekuza? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Amutondezhe michelo ipa kwaamba mwakasanduka. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Alimwi mutanokulyambauzha kwaamba, tulichite Ablahamu mbuli ishi wesu. Kashimpe ndamwaambila kwaamba, kuzwa kumabwe aya Leza ulakonzha kwasandula kuba bana a Ablahamu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Keembe kalibambilwe kale kumiyanda, alimwi mfumbwa chisamu chitazhali michelo mibotu chilaakutemwa a kusowegwa mumulilo. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Ndamubbizha amaanzhi kutondezha ati mwasanduka, pesi uyo uchite nguzu kwiinda ndime utekuza munshi lyangu ulakumubbizha a Muuya Usalala a mulilo. Ngumunene kwiinda ndime, nshelele akunyamuna nkwabilo zhakwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Ulichite Lubaango mumanza akwe, ulakuululula akulongela maila mubutala, pesi bwalo buugu bulakupya mu mulilo utazhimi.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubbizhigwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maako 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luuka 3.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ku chiindi icho Jesu wakazwa ku Galilaya akuza ku Jodani mukubbizhigwa a Joni. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Pesi Joni wakalinga wamukasha akwaamba ati, “Ndyelele kubbizhigwa andiwe,” “Ono iwe alimwi waza kuli ndime!”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Akubebobo ono. Munzhila iyi tulachita zhoonse Leza nzhayanda.” Amane Joni wakazumina.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Jesu nakamana kubbizhigwa nakazwa mu maanzhi, peenka penka julu lyakajaluka, alimwi wakabona Muuya wa Leza kauza anshi mbuli nkwilimba akukkala ali nguwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Amane jwi lyakanvika kuzwa ku julu lyaamba ati, “Uyu ngu Mwana angu ngu nyanda, mulinguwe munkomanina.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Wakasunkwa mulukula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Maako 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luuka 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ono Jesu wakatolwa a Muya Usalala kunka mulukula a kusunkwa amubibi <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Nakamana kuliimya kwa malumwi a mashiku ali makuumi one, wakanva nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Satani wakaza kuli nguwe akumusunka waamba ati, “Naa uli Mwana a Leza ambila mabwe aaya abe chinkwa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Chililembelwe ati, “Muntu taponi boo a chinkwa cheenka. Pesi ulapona a jwi lyoonse lizwa kuli Leza.”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Amane dyabooli wakamutola mu munzhi Usalala mu Jelusalema, wamutantika ansonga yachiluli cha tempele. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Akwaamba kuli nguwe ati, “Naa uli Mwana a Leza, liwaale anshi, nkambo malembe alaamba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">Leza ulakulailila bangele bakwe kuli ndiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">balakukujata amaanza aabo kwaamba myeendo yako itaumi amabwa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Chilimbelwe ati, ‘Utasoli Mwami Leza wako.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Amane dyabooli wakamutola Jesu ajulu a mulundu ulaamfu akumutondezha malelo a nyika yoonse mu bulemu bwangayo. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Dyabooli wakaamba ati, “Izhi zhoonse ndakupa, naa unfugamine akunkomba.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Jesu wakamunviila ati, “Kozwa awa Satani! Malembe alaamba ati, “Komba Mwami Leza wako akusebenzela nguwe boo eenka!”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Nakaunka Satani, bangele bakaza alimwi kumugwasha Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatalika mulimo wakwe mu Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maako 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luuka 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ono Jesu nakanva ati Joni waangwa muntolongo, wakazhokela ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Taaku nakakkala ku Nazalati, pesi wakaunka mukukkala ku Kapenaumu, wakalinga kufafi a mulonga wa Galilaya kunyinza ya busena bwa Zebuluni a Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />kuzuzikizha chakaamba mushishimi Izaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />“Nyika ya Zebuloni a nyika ya Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">nzhila iya ku mulonga unene kwiindilila Jodani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya munzhi waba Mashi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Bantu bakalinga kukkala mu munshinzhe bakabona mumuni unene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">abo bakkala muchinvule chalufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">mumuni wabamunikila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Kuzwa chiindi icho Jesu wakatalika kukambauka makani akwe ati, “Amusanduka kuzwa ku zhizhibibi zhanu, nkambo Bulelo bwaku julu buli afaafi!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaita bashichiiya bali bone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maako 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luuka 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Mbuli Jesu mbwakali kweenda kumbali a molonga wa Galilaya, wakabona bamukowa bobilo, Saimoni witwa Peter amukwabo Andulu, kabawaala ntaangala zhaabo mumulonga. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amunchilile ndamuiisha kuba bazeli ba bantu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Peenka peenka bakashiya ntangala zhaabo akuunka anguwe.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Kaeenda boo alimwi wakabona bamakwabo bolilo, Jemusi a Joni bana a Zebediya, kabali mubwaato abaishi ba Zebediya, kababamba ntangala zhabo, amane Jesu wakabaita. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Peenka penka bwaato bwabo bakabushiya boo abaishi akuchilila Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaiisha, wa kakambauka alimwi akuponya balwazhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luuka 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Jesu wakaunka mu Galilaya moonse, akuiisha muma Sinagogo, kaambilizha mulumbe mubotu wa bwami, alimwi aku ponya bantu Malwazhi apusene pusene. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Impuwo ya Jesu yakanviika nyika yoonse ya Siliya, alimwi bantu bakaleta balwazhi bapusene pusene kuli nguwe, ababo bakali kuchite machise, bakalikuchite maankutu, abakali kuwa kashiita abakalikuchite myuuya ibibi, abalikuyuminine mibili boonse wakabashilika akubaponya. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ono mabunga aanji akamuchilila kuzwa ku Galilaya, Dekapolisi, Jelusalema, Judiya alimwi a kuzubuka Jodani boonse bakamuchilila.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Kukambauka kwa Jesu a mulundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ono Jesu nakabona mbunga wakatanta ashoonto a mulundu, waakkala anshi, amane bashichiiya bakwe bakamubunganina. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />alimwi wakatalika kubaiisha ati,<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomana kwanchobeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luuka 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Balilelekelwe abo bachete mu Muuya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">nkambo bwami bwa ku julu mbubwabo.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />“Balilelekelwe abo balila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">nkambo balakumbuluzhigwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />“Balilelekelwe abo baboombu mu myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">nkambo balakukona nyika.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />“Balilelekelwe abo banva nzala a nyotwa yabululami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">nkambo bala kukuta.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />“Balilelekelwe abo bachite luzhalo kuli bamwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">nkambo Leza ulakubabela a luzhalo abalo!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />“Balilelekelwe abo basalala mu myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">nkambo balakubona Leza.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />“Balilelekelwe abo baleta lumuno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">nkambo balakwiitwa ati bana ba Leza.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />“Balilelekelwe abo ba penzhegwa nkambo ka bululami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">bulelo bwa ku julu mbubwabo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Walelekwa iwe na bantu ba kutukana, ba kupenzha aku kwaamba zhi biibi zhoonse a nkambo kakuchilila ndime. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Amusekelele a kukomana kwiindilile, nkambo bulumbu bwanu mukati ka Julu mbunene, munzhila yenka ba Shinshimi bakutaguna mbubakapenzhegwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sautu a mumuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maako 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luuka 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Alimwi muli mbuli sautu wa nyika, pesi naa sautu wachileka kulweela, inga wababuti sautu alimwi? Tauchili sautu ubotu kusebenzezha, pesi kuusowa boo akulyatauka amyeendo.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Muli mumuni wa nyika yoonse. munzhi uyakilwe a muludu utakonzhi kusisiwa <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Taaku muntu uyasha lilampi akubika munshi a mutaanga, pesi lila bikwa a Tebuulu kwaamba lipe mumuni bantu boonse bali mu ng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Munzhila yeenka mumuni wanu kaumunika kubantu, kwaamba babone milimo yanu ibotu a kulumbaizha Ishi wanu uli ku julu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha zha mulawo wa Mozesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />“Ono mutayeye kwaamba ndaza mukunjaya Milawo ya Mozesi alimwi anjiisho zhabashinshimi, taaku ndaza mukuikusha pesi kwizuzikizha. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Kashimpe ndamwaabila, mpaka Julu a nyika zhikainde pesi taaku nakaba kabala kashoonto kashi kakazwe ku milawo kushikila kumamanino. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Abobo, anu ndamwaambila, uli oonse ubika ambali nakaba kashoonto ka milawo iyi akuiisha bantu kwaamba bachite chechi, uyo ulakuba mushalizhi mu bwami bwa ku julu, pesi uyo ulemeka mulawo akuiisha bamwi ulakuba munene mu bwami bwa ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Kashimpe ndamwambila, chiita boo kusalala kwanu kwaiinda ba maii ba milawo a ba mafalisi tamukanjili mu bwami bwa ku julu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha a kukalala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luuka 12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Mwakanva bantu mbubakaambilwa kaiindi ati, “Utajai, uuyo uli oonse ujaya ulakubetekwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Pesi ndamwaabila ulioonse uukalalila mukwabo musankwa naa mukaintu ulakubetekwa. Mfumbwa uyo oonse ukalalila mukwabo musankwa naa mukaintu ulakutolwa ku nkuta inene. Mfumbwa waambila mukwabo ati, ‘Taaku mbobele iwe!’ Ulakutolwa ku nkuta yama Juuda. Mfumbwa uyo waambila mukwabo ati, ‘Uli muyozhi iwe’ ulyelele kuwaalwa mukalambwe ka mulilo. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Abobo, naulanda kupa chipo chaako a chipaililo, amana wayeeya ati wakakulubizhila mukwanu, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />Shiya chipo chako kumpela a chipaililo, wamana uunke ulekelelane a mukwanu, amana uze upe chipo chako kuli Leza.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Amana mubambe kambo kufambana ashinkondonyoko kamuchiya kweenda munzhila kuunka ku nkuta. Katana akukutola kubabeteshi shinkondonyoko alimwi babeteshi kabatana kukwaba mu maanza a balindizhi inga bakuwaalwa muntolongo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Kashimpe nda kwambila ati, uumo tokazwi mpaka ukabbadale maali elele.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha a chimambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />“Alimwi mwakanva mbu chakambwa ati, ‘Utachiti chimambe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Pesi ndamwaabila, mfumbwa ulanga mukaintu a mizeezo mibiibi wachita kale chimambe anguwe mu moyo wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Naa liinso lyako lya kululyo ndilikupa kulubizha, ligushe ulisowe, nchibotu wasowekelwa chibeela chomwi chamubili wako, kwiinda mubili oonse kuwaalwa mu gehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Naa lyaanza lyako lya kululyo ndilikupa kwaamba ati kolubizha, ligushe uli sowe, nchibotu kusowekelwa chibeela kwiinda mubili wako oonse kuwaalwa mu gehena.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha makani akulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateyo 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Maako 10.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luuka 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />“Chakaambwa ati, ‘Mfumbwa uleka mukaintu wakwe ulyelele kumupa chipepa chitondezha kulekana.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Pesi ono ndamwaabila mfumbwa uuleka mukaintu wakwe, kutaashi makani a chimambe, wamuchitizha chimambe, alimwi mfumwa wakwata mukaintu wakalekwe wachita chimaambe.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha a zhikonke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />“Mbuli mbu mwakanva chakaambwa ku bantu bakaindi ati, ‘Utaleki kuchita nchiwakashomezha, utakonkezhi chakubeja, pesi chita nchiwakakonkezha ku Mwami naa wakonkezha.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Pesi ono ndamwaambila ati, utalumbili chiindi nupanga chikonke, nakuba ku julu, nkambo chi nchuno cha Leza. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Utalumbili nakuba anshi nkambo mpa chipumunino chamyeendo yakwe, utalumbili nakuba ku Jelusalema, nkambo ngu munzhi wa mwendelezhi munene. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Alimwi utalumbili a mutwi waako, nkambo inga tokonzhi kushizha naa kutubya mususu nauba omwi.<verse eid="MAT 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Mfumbwa nchiwaamba kachiba chakuzumina boo naa kukaka, mfumbwa nchimwaamba chiinda wawa chilazwa ku mubiibi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha akujolela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luuka 6.29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />“Mwakanva mbuchakaambwa ati, ‘liinso ku liinso, alimwe liino ku liino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Pesi ono ndamwaambila, mutazholi chibi ku wamulubizhila. Naumwi wakuuma kuli chiili lyakululyo, mupe alichiili lyakulumweshi alyalo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Alimwi naa umwi wakutola kunkuta akukwangisha alimwi kayanda chakusama chaako, mupe achakulivumba achalo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Alimwi naumwi wakushinikizha kunyamuna katundu maile yomwi, enda a nguwe mamaile obilo. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Mupe uyo ukulomba, alimwi uyo uyanda kukweleta utamukashi.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyando kuba shinkondonyoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luuka 6.27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />“Mwakanva mbuchakaambwa ati, ‘Yanda mweenzhinyoko, sulaika shinkondonyoko. <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Pesi ono ndamwaambila amuyande bashinkondonyoko, a ku bapailila ba mupenzha <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Kwaamba mube bana baishi wanu uli ku julu. Nkambo walo lizuba lyakwe lila bala ku babiibi a babotu boonse. Alimwi ulaloshela mvula kubabishi abaluleme. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Naa mwayanda boo bamuyanda ino mbulumbu nzhi mbomunjana? Ino saa bashimutelo balo tabachiti ubo! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Alimwi naa mula ambauzha boo beenzhinyoko, nchinzhi saa kuli nchimwachita kwiinda bamwi? nkambo abalo bamashi balachita bweenka! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Amululame bweenka Ishi wanu waku julu mbwaluleme.<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kuiisha makani a kupa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />A muchenjele mutatondezhi bululami bwanu ku menso a bantu kwaamba ba mubone. Naa mwachita ubo mulakubula bulumbu kuli Ishi wanu waku julu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />“Ono naa mwapa batachite, mutaambilizhi a kulizha mpeta, mbuli bashikupaupa amenso mbubachita mu ma sinagogo a mu manzhila, balachita ubo nkubayanda kulumbaizhigwa ku bantu. Kashimpe ndamwambila abo, batambula kale bulumbu bwabo buzwile. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Pesi naa mwapa ku batachite lyaanza lyakulumweshi litazhibi nchilyachita lyanza lyakululyo, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Kwaamba kupa kwako kube kwa maseseke. Kuchita kwaamba Ishi wanu ubona nzhimwakachita mu maseseke, akamupe bulumbu.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha a mupailo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />“Chiindi nimupaila, mutabi mbuli bashikupaupa amenso! Balayanda kupaila kabainvi muma sinagogo a mu manzhila kwaamba ati bababone bantu. Kashimpe ndamwambila, ba tambula kale bulumbu bwabo buzwile. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Pesi chiindi mwayanda kapaila amunjila mu ng'anda, a kujala mulyango, a kupaila kuli Ishi wanu utaboneki. Alimwi Ishi wanu ubona zhisisilwe ulamuupa bulumbu.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Ono Chiindi mwayanda kupaila mutanakwindulukila kupaila, mbuli bakunze mbubayeeya kaamba ati balabanva kuli Leza wabo. Balo balayeeya ati baamba majwi aanji, balanvika kuli Leza wabo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Mutabi mbuli mbabo, nkambo Ishi wanu ulizhi kale nchimuyanda kamutana kulomba. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Mbobu ono mbumwelele kupaila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Tata esu uli ku julu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">liina lyanu lya bulemu a lilemekwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />bulelo bwanu a buze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">luyando lwanu a luchitwe anshi ano bweenke mbuli julu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Tupe sunu chankulya chalyoonse.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Tujatile kulubizha kwesu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">mbuli mbotulekelela ba tulubizhila.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Mutatunjizhi mu masunko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">pesi a mutugushe ku mubiibi.’ Nkambo bwami mbubwanu alimwi anguzu abulemu kukabe kutamani.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Naa mwalekelela ba mubulubizhila, Ishi wanu uli ku julu ulakumulekelela. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Pesi nakamutalekeleli bamwi awalo ishi wanu takamulekeleli nzhibyabi zhanu.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuiisha akuliimya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />“Alimwi chiindi mwana kuliimya mutanokuboneka mbuli ba shikupaupa a menso mbu bachita. Balo balazhoola machu abo kubonwa kwaamba ba laliimya, kashimpe ndamwabila, ba tambula kale bulumbu bwabo buzwile. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Pesi chiindi mwana kuliimya, amusambe ku menso a kunana mafuta kumutwi. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Kwaamba bantu ba tazhibi ati mulaliimya, pesi Ishi wanu boo eenka, utaboneki, alimwi Ishi wanu ubona zhichitika mu maseseke ulakumupa bulumbu.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buvubi mukati ka julu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luuka 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Mutabiki buvubi bwanu ano a nyika, walo munswa andala mpuzhinyonyola, kwalo uko bafumpi nku banjila akwibba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Pesi a mubike buvubi bwanu ku Julu, kwalo uko munswa a ndala nkuzhitanyonyoli naba mubbi ku njila a kwibba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Nkambo uko kuli buvubi bwanu nkukuli moyo wanu.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mumuni wamubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34">Luuka 11.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:36">36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />“Menso ndilampi lya mubili, naa menso anu kabona kabotu, mubili oonse ulazula mumuni. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Pesi naa menso anu katali kabotu, mubuli oonse ulazula mushinzhe. Naa mumuni mulindimwe waba mushinzhe, ino mushinzhe ulaba unene buti!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leza abuvubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luuka 16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Taaku muzhike winga waba aba shimalelo bobilo, inga wabula kuyanda omwi, omwi inga wamuyanda, ulakushomeka kuli omwi pesi kuli umwi takashomeki. Ono inga tosebezeli Leza alimwi a maali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutalibiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Ono ndamwambila ati, “Mutalibiliki a buumi bwanu naa nchishimukulye naa kunwa, naa a zha kumibili yanu naa chakusama. Amana saa buumi tabuyandiki kwiinda chakulya alimwi mubili kuyandika kwiinda zhakusama? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Amulange bayuni bamujulu, tabashangi, naa kutebula a kubika zhakulya mumatala, pesi Ishi wanu wakujulu ulabasanina zhakulya! Saa ntamuyandiki nkwiinda bayuni? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Saa imwe mukulibilika kwanu kuli winga wabikila kaindi kashonto kubuumi bwakwe?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Nkambo nzhi chimulibilika a zhakusama? Amulange malubaluba a mushonkwe mbwakomena, tasenbezi naa kulibambila zhakusama. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Pesi ndamwaambila a mwami Solomon mu buvubi bwakwe boonse taaku nakalinga kuchite zhisani zhibotu mbuli malubaluba aaya. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Naa mbubobo Leza mbwasamika bwiizu bwamushokwe, ubo buliko sunu alimwi jilo bwawaalwa mumulilo, saa takamusamiki kwiinda imwe, imwe nimuchite lushomo lushonto!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Ono mutalibiliki akwaamba ati, ‘Tula kulya nzhi?’ Naa ‘Tulakunwa nzhi’ naa ‘Tulakusama nzhi?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Pesi bakunze balazhibalikila zhintu izhi zhoonse, Pesi imwe Ishi wanu waku julu ulizhi ati mulayandika kuba a zhoonse izhi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Anu, amutagune kulangaula bwami bwa Leza, a bululami bwakwe, zhintu zhoonse neshi akamupe. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Abobo mutalibiliki a buzuba bwajilo, bwajilo bulakulibilika bwiine. Buzuba a buzuba bulichite mapenzhi ambubo.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kubeteka bamwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luuka 6.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />“Utabeteki bamwi kwaamba andiwe utakabetekwi, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />nkambo Leza ulakukubeteka munzhila yeenka njiwakabetekela moo bamwi, andiwe ulakukubeteka bweenka. Chipimo cheenka chimwakasebenzha kubetekela moo bamwi. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Nkambo nzhi, ulabona chisamu chili muliinso lya mweenzhinyoko washiya kubona chili muliinso lyako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Inga waambila buti mukwanu ati, ‘Leka nkugushe kapapu kali muliinso lyako,’ kakuli muliinso lyako muli chipapu chinene? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Nubashikupaupa amenso! Tanguna gusha chisamu chili muliinso lyako, amane neshi ubone kabotu kugusha kasamu kali muliinso lyamukwanu.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Alimwi mutapi babwa chintu chisalala nkambo inga bakumusandukila akumuluma, alimwi mutasoweli nkuumba mabwe amwekamweka addula nkambo zhilalayatauka boo amyeendo.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomba, langaula konkomona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luuka 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Lomba ulapegwa, langaula ulajana, konkomona ulajalulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Mfumwa ulomba oonse ulapegwa, ulangaula ulajana alimwi mulyango ulajalulilwa kuli oonse uyo ukonkomona. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ino alindimwe nguni wiinga wapa mwanakwe libwe, naa walomba chinkwa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Saa inga mwamupa inzoka naa walomba nswi? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Nakuba kwaamba muli babiibi, mulizhi kupa zhipengo zhibotu kubana banu. Ino mbuti walo Ishi wanu wa ku julu mbwiinga wapa zhipengo zhibotu kuli babo bamulomba!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Mulizhoonse kamuchita kuli bamwi nchimuyanda ati ba muchitile adimwi, ono nkambo ngu mulawo wa Mozesi a bashinshimi mbuwaamba.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyango ushoonto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luuka 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />“Ono amunjile mu mulyango ushoonto, nkambo mulyango unene a nzhila ikwazamukile ilatola kukunyonyoka, alimwi mbaanji baisebenzha nzhila iyi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Pesi nzhila njishoonto alimwi ilishankene iyo itola ku buumi, alimwi mbashoonto baijana.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisamu a michelo yanchicho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luuka 6.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />“Amuchenjele a bashinshimi babeji, balaza kuli ndimwi kabasamine zhikobela ansengwe zha mbelele, pesi mukati kabali baumpe bamushokwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Kwiinda mu michelo yabo mulakubazhiba. Saa bantu ing bachela masansa ku chisamu cha myunva, naa inkuyu kuzhala mutubetube. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Chisamu chibotu chilazhala michelo mibotu, pesi chisamu chibiibi chilazhala michelo mibiibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Chisamu chibotu inga tachizhali michelo mibiibi naa chisamu chibiibi kuzhala michelo mibotu. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Chisamu chilichoonse chitazhali michelo mibotu chilaakutemwa a kuwaalwa mu Mulilo. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Nkukaambo ako Mulakubazhiba kwiinda mu Michelo yabo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shindakalinga kumuzhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luuka 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Tabashi boonse baamba ati, ‘Mwami, Mwami’ beshi bakanjile mu bwami bwa ku julu, pesi chita abo bachita luyando lwa Taata uli ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mu chiindi chalubeta, baanji balakwaamba kuli ndime ati, ‘Mwami, Mwami! Mu liina lyako twakashinshima, twakagusha myuuya mibiibi mu liina lyako, alimwi twakachita maleele maanji mu liina lyako!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Amana ndakubaambila ati, ‘Taaku nshindakalinga kumuzhi. Kamuzwa kuli ndime nubabishi!<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bayaki bamanda bobilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luuka 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Ono mfumbwa uyo unva majwi angu akwachilila, uli mbuli muntu musongo wakayaka ng'anda yakwe alibwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Invula yaaloka, ayalo milonga yakazula, awalo muuwo wakaunga ku ng'anda ilya, pesi taina kuwa nkambo intalisho yanjiyo yakalinga alibwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Alimwi uyo oonse unva majwi angu aya a kutaachita, uli mbuli muyozhii wakayaka ng'anda yakwe a museenga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />“Pesi uyo onse unva majwi angu alimwi wabula kuchita nchaamba uli mbuli muyozhi wakayaka nganda yakwe a musenga, alimwi invuula yakaloka, milonga yakazula muwo wakaunga akuma kulubumbu lwa ng'anda, alimwi yakapasauka akuwa mpoo!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguzu zha Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ono Jesu nakamana kwaamba kambyo aka, imbunga yabantu yakakankamana kunjiisho yakwe, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />nkambo wakaisha mbuli muntu uchite nguzu, alimwi kutaashi mbuli ba maii babo ba milawo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu waponya shimankuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maako 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luuka 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Jesu nakaselemuka kuzwa a mulundu, imbunga ya bantu yaka muchilila. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Amane muntu wakalinga kuchite mankuntu, wakaza kufugama kuli Jesu a kwaamba ati, “Mwami naa koyanda nsalanzhe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Jesu wakatandabika lyaanza lyakwe a muntu, akumwaambila ati, “Ndayanda,” salala ono! Peenka penka muntu wakaponeshegwa kuzwa kumankuntu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Ama ne Jesu wakamwambila kwaamba, nkonva utaambili uli oonse, pesi kounka ulitondezhe ku mu Paizhi a kupa muyasilo mbuli Mozesi mbwakalailila chintondezha ku bantu boonse kwaamba ati wasalazhigwa kumankutu.<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musebenzhi wa shikalumamba munene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luuka 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ono Jesu nakanjila mu Kapenaumu, shikalumamba wachi Looma wakaza kuli Jesu a kulomba lugwasho, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />Mwami, “Musebenzhi wangu wachiswa kuyuminina mubili ku ng'anda alimwi mubili uliyuminine maningi.<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Jesu wakaamba ati, “Ndaunka muponye,”<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />“Shikalumamba wakanviila ati, “Toelele kwaamba uza ku ng'anda yangu. Amba boo majwi musebenzhi wangu ulapona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ime, ndi muntu upelwe nguzu zhakwendelezha bashikalumamba, ndalailila omwi, ‘Kounka!’ ulaunka, alimwi ndamulailila kwaamba koza!’ ulaza, a ku muzhike wangu ndamulailila ulachita bweenka.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Jesu nakanva makani aya, wakakankamana, alimwi wakaambila baali kumuchilila, “Kashimpe ndamwaabila, nshina kujana wa lushomo lunene mbuli ulu mu Izilaili. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />“Ndamwaabila, baanji balakuzwa kujwe, kumbo a kukkala kulya antomwi a Ablahamu, Izeki a Jakobe mu bwami bwa ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Pesi abo belele kujanika mu bulelo balakuwalwa ansengwe a munshinzhe, kwalo nkweshi bakalile aku lumanya meeno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Amane Jesu wakaambila shikalumamba ati, “Kounka ku ng'anda nchiwashoma chachitika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">“Peenka penka musebenzhi wakwe wakaponeshegwa.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya bantu baanji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maako 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luuka 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Jesu nakaunka mu ng'anda ya Petulo, alimwi wakabona bapongoshi ba Petulo kabonene abulo nkambo balinga kuchiswile mubili kupya. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Wakabajata kulyaanza lyabo, amane peenka penka kupya kwa mubili kwakamana, bakabuka a kubapa chakulya. <verse eid="MAT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Mangolezha enka ayo, bakamuletela bantu baanji bakalinga kunjililwe myuya ibibi, wakaitanda myuya ibibi a kusenbezha ijwi, alimwi boonse balwazhi bakalikushiswa. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Izhi zhakachitika zhoonse kuzuzikizha chakaamba mushishimi Izaya.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">Wakaponya malwazhi a machise esu oonse.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chili mukuchilila Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luuka 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Jesu nakabona mbunga yabantu yakalinga kumuzhingulukile, wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe kwaamba bazubukile kutala a mulonga. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />“Amane muii wa mulawo,” wakaamba ati, “O Muii ndilibambile kunka andiwe mfumbwa nkweshi uunke.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Bamwaaba bamushokwe balichite malyango abalo bayuni balichite nzhiinswa, pesi Mwana Muntu tachite akoona.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Shichiiya umwi wakamwaambila ati, “Mwami, ndalomba ngunke nka zhiike bata.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />“Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nchilile, amuleke bafile bazhikane beene.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu waumuzha mayuwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maako 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luuka 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Jesu wakanjila mu bwaato, alimwi bashichiiya bakwe bakamuchilila. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Peenka penka kwakaza muwo unene amulonga wakanyamuna mayuwe akatalika kuma kubwaato, pesi Jesu wakalikonene. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakaunka ku mubusha, akwaamba, “Mwami tuvune, twaloba!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Wakabanviila ati, “Nubantu balushomo lushoonto, nkambo nzhi nchimutija?” Amane wakanyamuka a kukalalila muwo a mayuwe, amana kwakaba lumuno.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Alimwi ba sankwa bakakankamana a kubuzha, “Ino ngu muntu buti uyu? Wakwaamba muwo a mayuwe oonse alamunvila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya bantu bobilo bakalikuchite myuya ibibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maako 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luuka 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Jesu nakashika kutala a mulonga mumunzhi wa Gadala, wakaswangana a abasankwa bobilo balinga kuchite myuuya ibiibi kabazwa kunamaumbwe. Taaku naba muntu omwi wakalinga kwiinda nzhila iyo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Penka bakaolobezha, “Ino ulandanzhi kulindiswe, O Mwana Leza? Saa waza mukutusubula chiindi kachitana kushika?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Kakutali kulale akwankalinga nkumba zhakalinga kuchela. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Amana myuuya ibiibi yakamulomba Jesu ati, “Naulanda kututanda, tutandile mubu takanga bwa nkumba zhilya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Jesu wakaambila myuuya ibiibi ati, “Kamuya!” alimwi yakazwa akunjila mu nkumba. Amane butakanga bwa nkumba boonse bwa kanyikila mu mulonga a kufa.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Bamane bembezhi ba nkumba bakabalika akunka mu munzhi kwaamba makani oonse, a nzhibakabona nzhakachitika ku basankwa ba myuuya ibiibi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Munzhi oonse wakaunka kubona Jesu. Nibakamana kumubona Jesu, bakamulomba kwaamba azwe mu chishi chabo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya wakalikuyuminine mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maako 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luuka 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Jesu wakanjila mu bwaato alimwi wakazubuka mulonga wakajokela kumuzhaabo. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Uko bantu bamwi nkubakamuletela muntu umwi wakalinga kuyuminine mubili, kawonene ampasa. Jesu nakabona lushomo lwabo, wakaambila muntu wakalinga kuyuminine mubili ati, “lya moyo mwanaangu, zhinyonyono zhako zhalekelelwa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Bamwi ba maii ba mulawo bakaamba mulwabo ati, “Uyu muntu uku nkusampaula nkwa tekuchita!” <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Jesu nakazhiba nchibakalikuyeya, wakabaambila ati, “Nkambo nzhi chimuyeya zhibiibi mu myoyo yanu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Nchili chuubu kwaamba ati, ‘Zhinyonyono zhako zhalekelelwa, naa kwaamba ati, ‘Nyamuka weende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ono pesi ndanda muzhibe kwaamba ati, Mwana a Muntu ulichite nguzu a nyika ano zhakulekelela zhinyonyono.” Ono wakaambila muntu wakalinga kuyuminine mubuli ati, “Nyamuka, bweza mpasa yako, kounka ku ng'anda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Peenka penka wakanyamuka a kuunka ku ng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ono imbunga ya bantu niyakabona chakachitika, bakatija, alimwi bakalumbaizha Mwami kupa nguzu zha bobu ku muntu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wakaiita Mateyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maako 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luuka 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Mbuli Jesu mbwakali kweenda, wakabona muntu wa liina lya Mateyo, shimutelo kashiite akavuka mpubakali kubbadalila mitelo, wakamwaabila, nchilile, alimwi Mateyo wakanyamuka akumunchilila.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Jesu kaachilya mu ng'anda ya Mateyo, bashimutelo baanji a bazhizhibi bakaza mukulya atomwi a Jesu a bashichiiya. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Alimwi bama Faliisi nibakabona, bakabuzha bashichiiya ba Jesu ati, “Nkambo nzhi muii wanu ulalya atomwi a bashimutelo alimwi a bazhizhibi?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Jesu nakanva wakaamba ati, “Bantu balikabotu tabayandiki mushilishi, Pesi balwazhi mbu bayandika boo mushilishi. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Pesi kamunka mubuzhe malembe aya nchaamba. ‘Ndanda luse kutaashi zhituuzho,’ Nshina kuza kwiita baluleme pesi bashizhibi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzho a Kuliimya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maako 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luuka 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Bamane bashichiiya ba Joni bakaza kuli Jesu a kubuzha ati, “Nkambo nzhi iswe a bama Falisi zhiindi zhinji tulaliimya kulya, pesi bashichiiya bako tabaliimyi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Mbuti beenzu bali abwiinga mbwiinga bakkala kabatalyi naa shibwiinga kachili a mbabo? Ubo tabushi! Pesi chilakushika chiindi shibwinga neshi a kabwezegwe akati kabo, amana balakuliimya.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Taaku naba omwi wiinga wa gambika chisani chipya achakaindi, nkambo chigamba chipya tachikajati pesi chilakukwamuna boo chilyango chinene achisani. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Taaku muntu wiinga watila wiini mupya muchipaya chakaindi, nawachita ubo, chipaya chilakonzha kupasuka wiini inga watika alimwi chipaya chilakonzha kunyonyoka. Taaku wiini upya uubikwa mu chipaya chipya kwaamba ukkale zhoonse zhobilo zhitanyonyoki.<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana mushimbi wa musololi a mukaintu wakakumya shisani cha Jesu kumpela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maako 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luuka 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ono Jesu kachaamba boo, musololi wa sinagogo wakaza a kufugama kuli Jesu, a kwaamba ati, “Mwanangu wafa ono ono. Ono koza ubike maanza ako a mwanangu amana ulaba kabotu,”<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Jesu wakanyamuka antomwi a bashichiiya bakwe akumuchilila.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ono umwi Mukaintu wakalikuchiswa bulwazhi bwa kalobola kwamyaka ikkumi ayobilo wakaza kunze kuli Jesu a kukumya kweela a chisani chakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Wakaamba mumoyo wakwe ati, “Nanjate boo chisani chakwe ndaba kabotu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Jesu nakachenguluka wakamubona mukaintu. “Wakamwaambila kati, “Lya moyo mwanangu! Lushomo lwako lwakuponya.” Peenka penka mukaintu wakapona.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Jesu nakanjila mu ng'anda ya musololi wa sinagogo, imbunga ya bantu kaiyobeka akulizha mitolilo, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />wakabaambila ati, “Amuzwile ansengwe noonse, nkambo mwaana tafile uloona boo.” Bamane boonse bakamuseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Pesi imbunga ya bantu mbubakazwila boo ansengwe, Jesu wakanjiila mu ng'anda akujata mwaana kulyanza awalo mwaana wakabubuka.<verse eid="MAT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Mulumbe uyu wakamwaika muchishi choonse.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya bantu bobilo boofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Mbuli Jesu mbwakalikweenda, basankwa bobilo boofu bakatalika kumuchilila, akolobezha kuli nguwe ati, “Mwana Devedi tunvile luzhalo!” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Chiindi Jesu nakanjila mu ng'anda, boofu bakaza kuli nguwe, alimwi Jesu wakababuzha ati, “Saa mulashoma kwaamba inga ndamuponya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">bakanviila ati, “Tulashoma O Mwami!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Amane Jesu wakajata menso abo, akwaamba ati, “A kuchitike anu bweenka mbuli mbumwashoma!” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Alimwi menso abo a kabona. Alimwi Jesu wakabachenjezha kwaamba, “Mutaambili naba omwi chachitika ichi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya muntu wakalinga chibuulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Pesi balo bakajokela alimwi a kumwaya mulumbe wa Jesu kuminzhii yoonse.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ono mbuli mbubakali kuzwa, bantu bakamuletela Jesu muntu wakalikuchite myuya ubibi alimwi kaali chibuulu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Alimwi ono muya ubibi niwakazwa muntu wakatalika kwaamba peenka penka, amana Imbunga ya bantu yoonse yakakankamana akwaamba ati, “Tatuna kubona ko chintu chabobu mu Izilaili.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Pesi bama Faliisi bakaamba ati, “Ngu musololi wa myuuya ibiibi umupa nguzu Jesu zha kugusha myuuya ibiibi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakabafila nkumbu bantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Jesu wakaunka mu minzhi inene a ishoonto yoonse a kuiisha muma sinagogo, a kukambauka Mulumbe Mubotu a bwami, a kuponya malwazhi a machise oonse. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nakabona mbunga ya bantu, moyo wakwe wakanva nkumbu nkambo bakalikupengekene a kubula lugwasho mbuli mbelele zhitachite mweembezhi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Ono Jesu wakambila bashichiiya bakwe, “Butebuzhi bwakomena pesi basebenzhi mbashoonto. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Amulombe Mwami mwiine wa butebuzhi atume batebuzhi mumunda wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatuma bashichiiya bakwe bali kkumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maako 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-19">Luuka 6.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Jesu wakaita bashichiiya bakwe bali kkumi abobilo, akubapa ngunzu zhakugusha myuuya ibiibi, akuponya malwazhi a machise oonse. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Aaya ngumaiina a batumwa bali kkumii abobilo. Saimon, wiitwa ati Petulo, a mukwabo Andulu, Jamusi mwana a Zebediya a mukwabo Joni, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo a Batilomeyo, Tomasi a Mateyo shimutelo, Jamusi mwana Alfasi, a Tadeyasi, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni muyandishi, a Juuda Isikalyoti wakaaba Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulimo wabashichiiya bali kkumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maako 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luuka 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Jesu wakabatuma bali kuumi abobilo, a kubapa malailile ati, “Mutaunki ku bakunze naa kunjila mu muzhi waba Samaliya, <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Pesi amukaunke ku Izilaili ku mbelele zhisowekele. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Mbuli mbumunka, mukakambauke makani aaya, ‘Bwami bwa ku julu bwasena!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Muponye balwazhi, mubabushe bafile, mubasalazhe balwazhi mankuntu, mugushe myuuya ibibi. Mwatambula chakutabadala, andimwe mukape chakutabadalisha. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Mutakatolezhi nsiliva, lubulo a ngolide mumakomwi anu, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />mutakanyamuni zhoola zhili zhoonse, naa zhinsani zhobilo, nazhiba nkwabilo naa nkoli, nkambo musebenzhi ulalya mpasebenzela.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Mfumbwa munzhi unene naa ushoonto ngushimukanjile mukalangaule muntu ushi a kamutambule, mukakkala anguwe mu ng'anda yakwe mpaka mukazweko. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Mwakunjila mu ng'anda, mwaambe ati, “Lumuno lube andimwe.” <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Naa mu ng'anda mumwanjila ba mutambula, kwanzha kwanu kwalumuno kukkalilile ambabo. Pesi naa bakakake kumutambula lumuuno lwanu lujokele kuli ndimwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Alimwi naa kwabula muntu naba omwi utambula naa kunva ku majwi anu, mukazwe mu nganda yakwe naa mu munzhi. mukapampe lusuko kumyeendo yanu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Kashimpe ndamwabila, Mwami Leza ulakutondezha luse ku bantu bamu Sodoma a Gomola kwiinda bantu ba mu munzhi ulya!<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzhi Atekuza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maako 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luuka 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Ono amunve! Ndamutuma mbuli mbelele a kati kabaumpe. Pesi amunchenjele mbuli nzoka alimwi mulibombye mbuli nkwilimba. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Amuchenjele, balakumwaaba kubashinkuta alimwi a kumukwipa mu ma sinagogo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Alimwi nkambo kangu, mulakutolwa kubendelezhi a ku bamami, mbuli kamboni kuli mbabo alimwi a bamashi, <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Pesi baakumwanga mutakapengi a chimuya kwaamba naa mbweshi mukaambe, nkambo kuchiindi icho muno kupelwe chakwaamba, <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Nkambo tamushi mushimukano kwaamba, pesi Muuya wa ishi wanu ngushi ukaambe kwiinda muli ndimwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Mukwabo ulakwaaba mukwabo kwaamba ajaigwe, awalo ishi ulakuchita bweenka kumwaana akwe, alimwi bana balakuzangila bazhali babo kwaamba bajaigwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Ono bantu boonse balakumusulaika nkambo kandime, pesi oonse uyo ujatisha a kubikilila kushikila kumamanino ulakufutulwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Naa bakamupenzha mu munzhi omwi, mukabalikile mu munzhi umbi. Kashimpe ndamwambila, tamukamanizhi kweenda minzhi yoonse ya Izilaili Mwana a Muntu katana kuza.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Taaku mwana a chikolo wiinda muii wakwe, naa musebenzhi wiinda shimalelo akwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ono bana a chikolo balyelele kuba mbuli muii wabo, a walo musebenzhi mbuli shimalelo akwe. Naa mwendelezhi wa ng'anda ulaitwa ati, Belezebule, Ina ba ng'anda yakwe balakwitwa mazhina aiinda kubija buti!<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguni welele kuloondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luuka 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ono mutaloondi bantu, nkambo taaku chivumbilwe cheshi chikabule kuvumbulwa naa chisisilwe cheshi chikabule kuzhibwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Mfumbwa nchindamwaambila mashiku mukachaamba malumwi, alimwi mfumbwa chimwakanva mukutepeta mumatwi, muachaambe atalala a zhiluli. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Mutaloondi bantu bajaya mubili pesi batachikonzhi kujaya Moyo, anu a muloonde Uyo ujaya zhoonse mubili a Moyo a kuwala mu Gehena. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Saa kangwee komwi inga takuli tuyuni tobilo? Pesi taaku nakaba komwi kaloka anshi kwakubula Leza kuzhiba. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Alimwi misusu ya mumutwi wanu uli ibelengele. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ono mutaloondi nkambo, mulayandika kwinda tuyuni tuunji!<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulyambilila akukaka Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luuka 12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“Abo bonse balyambilila nchatangalala ati balazulilwa kulindime, ndakuchita bweenka kuli Taata waku julu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Pesi uyo oonse unkaka chantangalala, andime ndakumukaka kuli Taata waku julu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutashi lumuno, pesi panga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luuka 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14.26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Mutayeye kwaamba ndaleta lumuno munyika, nshina kuleta lumuno, pesi panga. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Ndaza mukulwanya mwaana musankwa a baishi, mwaana mukaintu a banyina, mwana mukaintu a bapongoshi bakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Bashinkondonyina a muntu balakuba banganda yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“Mfumbwa uyandisha baishi naa bayina taele kuba muchilili wangu. Mfumbwa uyandishisha mwana akwe musankwa naa mukaintu taele kuba muchilili wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mfumbwa utabwezi chingano changu telele kuba muchilile wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mfumbwa ulangaula bumi bwakwe, ulakubusowekelwa, pesi oonse uyo usowekelwa bumii bwakwe nkambo kandime ulakubujana. <verse eid="MAT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Mfumbwa uyo umutambula, watambula ndime alimwi oonse uyo utambula ndime watambula uyo wakantuma.<verse eid="MAT 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulumbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maako 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Alimwi uyo oonse utambula mushishimi nkambo kwaamba ati ngu mushishimi ulakutambula bulumbu bwa chishishimi alimwi uyo oonse utambula muntu Usalala nkambo ati ulasalala ulakutambula bulumbu bwa muntu Usalala. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Alimwi uli oonse upa lufulu lwa maanzhi kuli baba bashoonto ba bashichiiya, kashimpe ndamwaambila, muntu uyo ulakutambula bulumbu bwakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Batumwa kuzwa kuli Joni mubbizhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luuka 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Jesu nakamana kupa malailile ku bashichiiya bakwe bali ikkumi abobilo, wakaunka akutalika kuiisha a kukambauka mu minzhi inene yaku Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ono Joni mumbbizhi kali muntolongo nakanva zhintu nzhakalinga kuchita Kilisitu, wakatuma bashichiiya bwakwe kulinguwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />“Twaambile,” bakamubuzha Jesu, “Saa ndiwe utekuza? Naa tuchilangila umbi?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Kamunka mu mwaambile Joni nchimwanva a nchimwabona. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Boofu babona, balema beenda, bashimankuntu basalazhigwa, batanvi banva bafile babushigwa, alimwi Mulumbe Mubotu wakambaukwa ku bachete <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ulilelekelwe uyo utaleki kushoma mulindime.<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ono batumwa ba Joni nibakaunka, Jesu wakatalika kwambila mbunga kujatikizha Joni “Nimwakaunka kuli Joni mukanda, nchinzhi nchimwalikulangila kubona? Saa mwakabona bwiizu kabunyanyala a muwo? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Naa tabushi, ina mwakaya mukubona nzhi? Saa Muntu walikusamine zhisani zhibotu? Taaku, abo basama zhisani zhidula balakala mumasena aba Mamii. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ino mwalinga mwaunka mukubona nzhi? Saa Mushishimi? Kashimpe ndamwaabila, mwakabona wiinda a mushinshimi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Joni nguwakalembwa mu malembe ati, ‘Ndakutumina mutumwa kumpela kwako, eshi akakubambile nzhila.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Ndamwambila kwaamba ati, akati kababo bakazhalwa kumukaintu taaku naba omwi unga waiinda Joni mubbizhi, kakuli uyo mushoonto mu bwami bwa ku julu munene kumwiinda. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Kuzwa kumazuba a Joni mubbizhi kushikila sunu, bwami bwa ku julu bwabwezwa changuzu nkambo bantu banyongene mbubabu bweza cha nguzu. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Bashinshimi boonse a milawo ya Mozesi bakalinga kushinshima a zha bwami kushikila Joni naakaza. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Alimwi naa mulazumina kutambula makani abo, Joni ngu Elija, wakashinshimwa ati ulaakuza. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Oonse uchite matwi anvishe!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Ino ono, bantu basunu inga ndabakozhanisha anzhi? Bali mbuli baana bashite mu masena akuuzhila kabaita benzhinyina ati, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Twakamulizhila nyimbo, taaku nimwakazhana twakaimba nyimbo zhapamalila, taaku mwakalila!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Joni nakaza takali kulya naa kunwa, alimwi bakaamba ati, ‘Ulichite muya ubiibi.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Ono Mwana a Muntu naakaza wakalinga kulya akunwa, alimwi bakaamba ati, ‘Amubone uuyu muntu ngu mulyato alimwi nguchakolwa, mweenzhinyina abashimitelo abashizhinyonyono!’ Michito ya muntu ilatondezha naa musongo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minzhi yatakali kushoma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luuka 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ono Jesu wakatalika kukalalila bantu bamuminzhi iyo mwakachitila malele nkambo taaku bakasanduka. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Maawe kulindimwe numinzhi ya ku Kolazini mawe kuli ndimwe Betisaida! Nkambo maleele akachitilwa muli ndimwe nakachitilwa mu Teli a sidoni, ninga bantu bakasanduka kaiindi akusama zhisani zhamasaka akunana milota. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Pesi ndamwaambila, mubuzuba bwalubeta, chisubulo chanu chilakwiinda cha Teli a Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Andiwe Kapenaumu, saa ulayeeya kwaamba balakukulumbaizha kujulu? Taaku, ulakuwaalwa mu gehena. Nkambo ka kwaamba maleele akachitwa muli ndimwe nakachitilwa mu Sodoma, ninga asunu munzhi uuyu kauchiliko! <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Pesi ndamwaambila ati, mubuzuba bwalubeta, chisubulo chanu chila kwiinda cha Sodoma!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuze kulindime mupumune</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Luuka 10.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Peenka penka Jesu wakapaila ati, “Ndakulumba Tata, Mwami wa julu a nyika, nkambo wakasisa zhintu izhi kubasongo a abaiile alimwi wakazhizubulula kubana bashoonto. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Mbumbubo Taata, mbuchakukomanisha kwaamba chibe.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Taata nguwakaampa zhintu zhoonse. Taaku naba omwi uumuzhi Mwaana chita boo Taata. Alimwi taaku muntu naba omwi uuzhi Taata chita boo Mwaana, akuli baabo Mwaana mbakasala kuzubulwila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Amuze kuli ndime, noonse nimwalemenwa kunyamuna mikuli ilemu, alimwi ndakumupa kupumuna, ndime nshi mulemunune. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Amubweze lijoko lyangu, mwiiye kulindime. Nkambo ime ndimubombu alimwi ndimubotu moyo, nchichecho mulakujana kupumuna mumyoyo yanu. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Joko lyangu Ndyubu alimwi mukuli wangu nguubu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mubuzho waamba a Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maako 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luuka 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ono mu chiindi icho, Jesu wakalinga kweenda mumunda wamaila mu Nsabata, amane bashichiiya bakwe bakanva nzala bakatalika kutyola mitwi ya maila akulya. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Bama Faliisi nibakabona icho bakamwaambila ati, “Bona bashichiiya bako batokuchita chitazumizhigwi amulawo mu buzuba bwa Nsabata <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Saa tamuna kubala Devedi nchakachita, chiindi walo abaabo mbakalinga ambabo nibakafa nzala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Wakaunka mu ng'anda ya leza, alimwi abenzhinyina bakalya chinkwa chisala chakapegwa kuli leza, iicho nchibatakali kwelele kulya, chita boo bapaizhi beenka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Saa taaku nimwakabala mumulawo wa Mozesi mbuli bapaizhi ba mu ng'anda ya leza mbubakali kutyola mulawo wa Buzuba ubu? pesi taaku nibakapegwa mulandu? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Ono ndamwaambila ati, ano mpali wiinda tempele. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Nimwakazhiba majwi aya nchaamba, ‘Ndanda luse kutaashi zhituuzho zha banyama,’ Nimwatakatamikizha bantu batachite mulandu. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Nkambo Mwana a Muntu ngu Mwami wa Nsabata.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu wakalikuchite lyaanza lyakalikuyuminine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maako 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luuka 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Jesu nakazwa kubusena uko wakaunka akunjila mu sinagogo yabo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Uuko kwakalinga musankwa umwi wakalinga mulema lyaanza. Amane bantu kabalangaula akumupela kaambo, bakamubuzha kwaambaati, “Saa chili mu mulawo kuponya muntu mu Nsabata?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Alimwi wakabanviila ati, “Ino nguni ali ndimwe wiinga kachite mbelele yomwi yawiila muchilindi mu buzuba bwa Nsabata amana saa inga taigushi? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Alimwi muntu ulayandika maningi kwiinda mbelele! Abobo mulawo ulazuminya kuchita chilikabotu mu buzuba bwa Nsabata.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Nakamana Jesu wakambila musankwa wakalinga kuyuminine lyaanzaati, “Olola lyaanza lyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Amane wakalyolola lyaanza lyakwe alimwi lyakaba kabotu bweenka mbuli lyeenzhinyina. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Penka awo, bamafaliisi bakaunka akupangana mbweshi ba mujaye Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musale wa Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ono Jesu nakanva mizezo njibakali kuchite ali nguwe wakazwako kubusena, alimwi imbunga yabantu yakamuchilila amane wakaponya boonse bakalinga balwazhi. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Alimwi wakabaambila kwaamba batamuyubululi. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Ichi chakachitika kuzuzikizha chakaamba Mumushishimi Izaya. “Ngooyu musebezhi wangu,<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />ngundakasala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ngunyandisha alimwi mulinguwe ndakomana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">ndakutuma Muuya wangu alinguwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Alimwi ulakwaambilizha lubeta lwakwe lulyelele ku nyika.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Takakazhi naa koolobezha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Taaku naba omwi eshi akanve jwi lyakwe mumazhila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Teshi akatyole katete kapapukile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">nakuba kuzhimya kamumuni kayaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Ulakuzumanana mpaka mashimpe akazunde.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Mu liina lakwe mashi alakubika bulangizhi bwabo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu bakamubejesha kusebenzha muya wa Belizebule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maako 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luuka 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Amane bakamuletela muntu wakalinga kuchite myuuya ibiibi wakalinga moofu alimwi kalichibuulu, alimwi Jesu wakamuponya, kuchita kwaamba aambe akubona antomwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ono mbunga yoonse ya bantu yakakankamana ku nchakachita. Bakabuzha ati, “Saa uyu inga kali Mwana a Devedi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ono pesi bafaliisi nibakanva ichi bakanviila ati, “Ngu beeluzebebu mweendelezhi wa myuuya ibiibi ngu umupa nguzu uyu mweenzuma zhakugusha myuuya ibiibi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ono Jesu wakazhiba nchibakali kuyeeya wakabaambila ati, “Naa bwami bwalilwana bwiine, bwami ubo bulafa. Alimwi munzhi naa mukwashi wapalangana akulilwana mukwashi uyo ulawa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Alimwi naa Satani walilwana mubwami bwakwe ulalilwana mwiine, ino ing bwami bwakwe bwaimikana buti? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Alimwi naa ndagusha myuuya ibiibi anguzu zha Beeluzabelu, amungabile, ino imwe bantu balasebenzha nguzu zhabaani kugusha myuuya ibiibi? Ono anu balakuba mbubabeteshi banu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Pesi naa kwiinda mu Muya wa Leza kwaamba ndagusha myuuya ibiibi, nkukwaamba bwami bwa Leza bwaza ali ndimwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />“Taaku muntu wiinga wanjila mu ng'anda yashimanguzu akubweza zhintu zhakwe, chiita watalikila kwaanga shinguzu uyu. Niinga wanjila kubweza zhintu mu ng'anda yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Alimwi mfumbwa muntu utali andime ngushinkodoma, mfumbwa utavuuni kubunganya ulamwaya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Akambo aaka, ndamwambila kwaamba bantu blakonzha kulekelelwa zhinyonyono azhibiibi nzhibaamba. Pesi uyo oonse usampaula Muuya Usalala takalekelelwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Alimwi oonse waamba zhimwi zhintu zhibiibi ku Mwana a Muntu ulakonzha kulekelelwa, Ono uuyo waamba zhibiibi ku Muuya Usalala takalekelelwi, ku chiindi chino nikuba ku chiindi chiza.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisamu a michelo ya nchicho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luuka 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Ono kwaamba ube muchelo ubotu, ulandika kuba chisamu chichite nseba ilikabotu, naa kochite chisamu chitalikabotu, ulakuba muchelo ubiibi. Chisamu chilazhibwa kwiinda mu michelo njichizhala. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Imwe nonzoka! Ino inga mwaamba buti zhintu zhibotu kakuli muli babiibi? Nkambo mulomo wa muntu ulaamba chizwile mukati ka moyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Muntu mubotu ulaleta zhintu zhibotu kuzwa muchibikilo sha zhintu zhibotu, muntu mubyaabi ulaleta zhintu zhibiibi zhizwa muchibikilo.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />“Nchobeni ndamwaambila kwaamba, mubuzuba bwalubeta bantu balakupegwa mulandu ku mazwi oonse atachite nchito ngubakaamba. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Majwi ako alakusebenzhegwa kukubeteka, kwaamba ulichite mulandu naa tochite.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitondezho cha Joona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maako 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luuka 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ono bamwi ba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi bakaambila Jesu ati, “O Muii,” “Tulanda kwaamba utuchitile chitondezho.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />“Wakanviila ati, “Musela ubiibi alimwi ushizhimambe, ulalomba chitondezho! Pesi taaku nachiba chomwi ncheshi bapegwe chita boo cha mushinshimi Joona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Bweenka Joona mbwakakkala mumala answi, mazuba otatwe a mashiku otatwe, Awalo Mwana Muntu ulakuba anshi a nyika kwamazuba otatwe a mashiku otatwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Buzuba bwalubeta, bantu baku Niniva balakuwimina musela uyu a kuupa mulandu, nkambo balo bakasanduka kuzwa kuzhibibi zhabo nibakanva Joona kakambauka, alimwi ndamwabila, nkwali muntu ano wiinda Joona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Buzuba bwalubeta muka Mwami uzwa ku musanza, ulakuwiimina uyu musela a kuupa mulandu, nkambo walo wakeenda kuzwa kweela kwa chishi kulaala a kuza mukunva ku yiisha kwabusongo bwa Sololmoni. Pesi ano nkwali muntu wiinda Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujokela kwa muuya ubiibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luuka 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Naa muuya ubiibi wazwa mu muntu, uleendaana muchipayuma a kulangaula busene bwakupumunina. Naa wabula kujana akupumunina, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Ulaamba, ‘Ndajokela ku ng'anda yangu, amana ulaunka a kujokela alimwi, naa wajana mu ng'anda taaku chilimo, ulabaamba mo kabotu. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Alimwi ula jokela a kuletelawo aimwi myuuya ibiibi iliciloba kwiinda nzhiyo, ilaza a kukkala. Amane buumi bwa muntu bulabija kwiinda mbubwakalinga kumatalikilo. Mbubobo mbweshi chikabe kumusela ubibi uyu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banyina Jesu a Bamakwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maako 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luuka 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Ono Jesu kachibandika ku mbunga ya bantu, banyina aba makwabo bakashika bakaimikana asengwe, kabayanda kwaamba anguwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Umwi wabantu wakamwaambila ati, “Banyoko abamakwanu baliinvi ansengwe, balanda kubandika andiwe.” <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ina ba maa a bamakwesu mbaani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Wakatondeka ku bashichiiya bakwe a kwaamba ati, langa, “Ba maa a bamakwesu mbaaba! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Mfumbwa uyo uchita nchayanda Taata waku julu, ngumukwesu alimwi mbu ba maa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Kambyo kamushangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maako 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luuka 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Alimwi mu buzuba bweenka Jesu wakazwa mu ng'anda, a kuunka kukkala kumbali a chizhiba. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Imbunga ya bantu yakamubunganina chakwaamba, Wakanjila mu bwaato a kukkala. Pesi imbunga yakashala kainvi kumbali a chizhiba. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Amane wakabaambila zhintu zhiinji kwiinda mu twaambyo, wakaamba ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Umwi mulimi wakaunka mukushanga mbuto yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Mbuli mbwakalinga kumwaya, imwi mbuto yakalokela munzhila, a balo bayuni bakaza a kwiilya <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Imwi yakalokela amabwe, alo awo atakalinga bulongo buunji. chakufambana yakamena, nkambo bulongo bwakalinga bushoonto, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Pesi lizuba nilyakabala chishango chakalinga kumenene chakayuma nkambo miyanda tiyakalinga anshi maningi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Imwi imbuto yakalokela mumyunva amane niyakakomena yakayaswa a myunva. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Pesi mbuto imwi yakalokela mubulongo bu botu, alimwi a kuzhala michelo ili chisambomwe, makumi otatwe, makkumi chiloba kwiinda yakashangwa,<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Mfumbwa uchite matwi, a nvishe!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupanduluzhi bwa kaambyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maako 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luuka 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Bashichiiya bakaza kulinguwe akubuzha ati, “Nkambo nzhi ulaamba mutwaambyo ku bantu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Jesu wakanviila ati, nkambo luzhibo lwa “Maseseke lwa bwami bwa ku julu bwa pegwa kuli ndimwe, pesi kutaashi kuli mbabo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Mfumbwa uchite ulakupegwa kwiindilila. Alimwi balaakuba anzhizho kwiindilila. Pesi uyo oonse utachite, akoko koonse nkubachite kulakunyangwa kuli mbabo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Nchicheco nchingambila mu twaambyo kuli mbabo. “Nibabona, tababoni, nibanva tabanvishi, tabanvi naa kunvisha. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Muli mbabo chishinshimi cha Izaya chakazuzikizhigwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Mulakuna kunva lyoonse pesi tamukanvishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">mulakuna kubona lyoonse pesi tamukaboneshi.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Nkambo mizeezo yabo njifaafi tabayeeyi kabotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">nchiyumu kunva amatwi abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">alimwi meenso abo bajala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Nikwatakalinga ubo, niinga abo meenso abo abona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">matwi abo nakanva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mizeezo yabo niinga yakanvisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">alimwi niinga bakasanduka, maamba Leza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">alimwi niinga ndabaponya.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Pesi alelekwa menso anu nkambo alabona, alimwi amatwi anu nkambo alanva. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Kashimpe ndamwaambila, bashinshimi baanji alimwi a bantu baluleme bakalikuyandishisha kubona nchimubona, Pesi taaku bakachibon, alimwi akunva nchimunva pesi taaku bakachinva.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakapandulula kambyo ka mulimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maako 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luuka 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Amunve ono ku kambyo kamulimi nchikaamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Naa umwi wanva makani abwami alimwi kataanvishi, mubibi ulaza akwabweza makani ayo akashangwa mu myoyo yabo. Iyi nimbuto yakashangwa kumbali a nzhila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Imbuto yakalokela amabwe ilaimikanina babo bantu, chiindi nibanva ijwi balautambula chakusekelela. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Pesi nkambo talichite miyanda, lilakkala boo chiindi chishoonto. Naa mapenzhi akupenzhegwa kwabashikila nkambo ka jwi, balafaambana akuwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Imbuto yakawila akati kamyunva ilaimikanina bantu banva jwi, pesi nkambo kakulibilika kwa buumi ubu alimwi akubejegwa kwa buvubi ijwi lilashinkilizhigwa kulichita kwaamba litazhali michelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Pesi imbuto yakawila mubulongo bubotu, ilaimikanina babo banva jwi alimwi akulinvisha. Iyi njiyeeyo izhala michelo, izhala mwaanda, chisambomwi naa zhiindi makkumi otatwe ku zhakashangwa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kambyo ka nzau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Jesu wakabaambila kambyo akamwi ati, “Bwami bwa ku julu buli mbuli muntu wakashanga mbuto ibotu mu muunda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Pesi boonse kaboona mashiku, shinkondonyina wakaza a kumwaya nzau akati ka maila, akaunka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ono maila nakakomena alimwi mitwi niyakaboneka, ayalo nzau yakaboneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basebenzhi bakaza kuli shemalelo wabo akubuzha ati, ‘Mwami saa tona kumwaya mbuto ibotu mu munda waako? Ino nzau zhazwa kuli?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />‘Shinkondoma nguwakachita ichi,’ wakabanviila. Basebenzhi bakamubuzha ati, ‘Saa ulanda tuunke tuzhizhule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Wakanviila ati, ‘Taaku,’ nkambo mwano kuzhuzula nzau mulanakuzhulila kuntukomwi a maila. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Amuzhileke zhikomenene antomwi kushikila chiindi chakutebula. Achiindi icho ndakubaambila batebuzhi kwaamba. Amutaangune kubwezelela nzau alimwi muzhaange mumile kwaamba zhitentwe, amane mubunganye maila akwaleta mubutala bwangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kambyo ka nseke ya masitadi a mimena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maako 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luuka 13.18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Ono wakabaambila kambyo a kamwi ati, “Bwami bwa ku julu buli mbuli ka nseke kamasitadi. Ako muntu nkabwaza a kushanga mu munda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Nakuba kwaaamba nkukaseke kashoonto anseke zhoonse, Pesi naa chakomena chilaba chinsamu, amana a tuyuni tulaza a kuyaka binswa mumitabi yanchicho.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo ka mamena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luuka 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Wakabaambila alimwi kaambyo a kamwi ati, “Bwami bwaku julu, buli mbuli mukaintu ubweza mamena a kusanganya magaloni onee a fulaulo, kushikila wafutumuka.” <verse eid="MAT 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Jesu wakaambila mbunga ya bantu zhintu zhoonse izhi mu twaambyo, taaku nakaamba chintu chili choonse kwakubula kusebenzha twaambyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Ono icho chakaambwa kwiinda mumushinshimi chakazuzikishigwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Ndakujalula mulomo wangu mu twaambyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Ndakwaamba zhintu zhisisilwe kuzwa chiindi nyika niyakalengwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakapandulula Kaambyo ka nzau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Amane Jesu wakaishiya mbunga ya bantu a kunka mu ng'anda, bashichiiya bakwe bakaza kuli nguwe a kwaamba, “Tupandulwile kaambyo ka nzau mu munda nchikaamba.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Wakanviila ati, “Uyo wakashanga mbuto ibotu ngu Mwana a Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Muunda nii nyika amana imbuto ibotu ilaimikanina bantu ba Bwami, Nzau mbantu bamubiibi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />alimwi shinkondoma wakamwaya mbuto ngu dyabooli. Butebuzhi mamanino a musela, alimwi batebuzhi mbangele. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Mbuli nzau mbuzhizhulaulwa a kuwaalwa mumulilo, ono mbweshi chikabe kumamanino a musela. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana a Muntu ulakutuma bangele bakwe kugusha zhoonse nzau mu Bwami bwakwe izho, zhichitisha bantu kubisha a kuchita zhibiibi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Balakubawaala mu mulilo ubbebbele umo mweshi bakalile a kulumanya meno, <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Amane baluleme balakumwekamweka mbuli lizuba mu Bwami bwa Ishi wabo. Oonse uchite matwi anve.<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kalubono lusisilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />“Ono bwami bwa ku julu buli mbuli lubono lusisilwe mumunda, naa muntu walujana ulalusisa alimwi ulaunka akuuzha zhoonse nzhachite alimwi a kuula munda uyo.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kambyo ka mabwe amwekamweka adduula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Alimwi bwami bwa ku Julu buli mbuli muntu shikuzha ulangaula mabwe amwekamweka adduula. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Ono naa waajana mabwe amweka mweka adduula, ulaunka alimwi a kuuzha zhintu zhakwe zhoonse alimwi akwaula.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kantangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />“Alimwi Bwami bwa ku julu buli mbuli bazeli ba nswi, bawala tunzabwe twabo mu maanzhi, a kujata nswi zhi pusene pusene. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ono naa ntangala yazula, muzeli ulaigusha mumanzhi a kwibika atala, amana akukkala anshi akutalika kusala nswi zhili kabotu a kuzhibika mumitaanga pesi zhibiibi zhoonse ulazhisowa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ichi mbweshi chikabe kumamanino a musela uyu, bangele balakuza a kwandanya baluleme kuzwa kubabishi <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />alimwi balakubawala mumulilo ubbebbele, mwalo umo mweshi bakalile a kulumanya meno.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mashimpe apya a kaiindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Ono saa mwazhiinvisha zhintu izhi zhoonse?” Jesu wakabuzha ati, “Mbumbubo,” bakanviila. <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Wakaamba kuli mbabo ati, “Abobo, oonse muii wamulawo uba shichiiya mu Bwami bwaku julu uli mbuli mwiine ng'anda ugusha zhintu zhipya a zhakaindi kuzwa mu ng'anda yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakakakwa ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maako 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luuka 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ono Jesu nakamana twaambyo utu, wakazwa kuzwa uko. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />alimwi wakajokela kumunzhi wamuzhaabo, wakatalika kuiisha bantu muma sinagogo abo, alimwi boonse bakamunva bakakankamana a kubuzha ati, “Ina uyu muntu busongo a nguzu zhamalele izhi zhoonse wakazhijana kuli? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Saa uyu taashi Mwana a shikubeza? Saa banyina tabashi ba Maliya, alimwi bamakwabo saa tabashi bene Jemusi a Josefa a Simyoni a Judasi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Saa bamakwabo ba makaintu tabali a ndiswe? Ina muntu uyu izhi zhintu zhoonse wakazhijana kuli?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Amane Jesu bakamukaka, Pesi Jesu wakabambila ati, “Mushinshimi ulalemekwa koonse pesi kutaashi mumunzhi wamuzhaabo a mukwashi wakwe.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Alimwi taaku nakachita maleele aanji kulya nkambo kakubula lushomo muli mbabo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Joni mubbizhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maako 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luuka 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ku chiindi icho Helodi mwendelezhi nakanva makani a Jesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />alimwi wakaamba kubasebenzhi ati, “Ngu Joni mubbizhi wabuka kuzwa kubafu! Nkukambo kako maleele akankamika anguzu alasebenza muli nguwe.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Ono Helodi wakajata akwanga Joni akumubika muntolongo nkambo ka Helodiyasi, muka mukwambo Filipo, <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Nkambo Joni wakalinga kwaamba kuli nguwe ati, “Tachili mu mulawo kuba anguwe.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Ono Helodi wakalinga kuyanda kujaya Joni, pesi wakalikutija bantu, nkambo boonse bakalinga kwaamba ati Joni ngu mushinshimi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ono buzuba bwakuyeeya kuzhalwa kwa Helodi, Mwana mushimbi wa Helodiyasi wakazhana kumpela kwa beenzu, alimwi Helodi wakakomana maningi <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />wakashomezha a chishomyo kwaamba mfumbwa ncheshi alombe ulamupa.<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Ono banyina bakamwambila cha kulomba chelele, wakaamba ati, “Amumpe mutwi wa Joni mubbizhi ambale.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mwami Helodi wakausa, Pesi nkambo kachishomyo nchakaamba kumpela kwa beenzu boonse, Wakapa malailile kwaamba ati mwana mushimbi apegwe nchakalomba <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />alimwi mutwi wa Joni wakazutulwa kali muntolongo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Amane mutwi wa Joni wakaletwa ambale akupengwa ku mwana mushimbi walo wakautola kuli banyina. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ono bashichiiya ba Joni bakaza a kubweza mubili akutola mukuuzhika, Amane bakaunka alimwi baka akwaambila Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakasanina zhuulu zhosanwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maako 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luuka 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ono Jesu nakanva chakachitika, Wakayubilila akuunka abwaato kubusena bumwiine. Amane imbunga ya bantu nibakanva, bakaishiya minzhi yabo a kweenda kuchilila Jesu nkwakalinga. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ono Jesu nakazwa mu bwaato wakabona mbunga ya bantu, alimwi moyo wakwe wakanva nkumbu amane wakaponya machise aabo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ono nakaba mangolezha bashichiiya bakwe bakaza kuli nguwe a kwaamba, “Kuno nkuushokwe amana kuluumwine, Bambile bantu baunke balyulile zhakulya zhabo mu minzhi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Tabelele kuunka imwe a mubape chakulya,”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Bakanviila ati, “Tuli chite boo zhinkwa zhosanwe a tuswi tobilo.<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amuzhilete kuno,’ <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Amane wakaambila bantu kukkala anshi abwiizu, wakabweza zhinkwa zhili zhosanwe a tuswi tobilo amana wakalanga ku julu a kupa kulumba ku Mwami, amane wakakomonakomona zhinkwa a kupa bashichiiya kwaamba babanye bantu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bakalya boonse a kukuta, alimwi bashichiiya bakabwezelela Mitaanga yazhakulya zhakashala ili Kkumi atobilo. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Basankwa bakalya bakalinga zhuulu zhosanwe, kutabalizha a bamakaintu a baana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakeenda a maanzhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maako 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Peenka penka Jesu wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe kunjila mu bwaato akuunka kulubazu lumwi, Pesi walo wakashaala kaambila mbunga ya bantu ati iunke. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ono nakamana kutanda mbunga ya bantu, Jesu wakaunka ku chilundu mukupaila eenka, alimwi nikwakainda chiindi mashiku Jesu kaali eenka, <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />alimwi kwa chiindi icho bwaato kabulikale akati kuzwa ku nyika, a nkambo ka kupenzhegwa amayuwe, muwo wakalinga kuuma ku bwaato.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Kuseniseni nibwakacha Jesu wakaza kuli mbabo kaeenda mu chizhiba, <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Bashichiiya nibakamubona kaeenda a chizhiba, bakaamba ati, “Nchibaanda,” alimwi bakatija a kulila.<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Peenka penka Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amuyume yume! ndime, “Mutatiji.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />“Mwami, nadiwe, Petulo wakanviila ati, “Ngambile nyeende a maanzhi nze kuli ndiwe.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Koza.” Amane Petulo wakaseluka kuzwa mu bwaato, a kweenda a manzhi kuchilila Jesu nkwakalinga. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Pesi nakabona muwo wakatija, alimwi nakabona ati wakatalika kubbila wakalila, “Mwami mvune!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Peenka peenka Jesu wakamujata. “Iwe nuuchite lushomo lushonto,” Wakamwaambila ati, “Nkambo nzhi toshomi?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Alimwi nibakanjila mu bwaato awalo muwo wakaumuna. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Alimwi bonse bakalinga mu bwato, bakamukomba a kwaamba, “Nchachobeni uli Mwana a Leza!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya mulwazhi mu Jenesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maako 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ono nibakamana ku zubukila kutala, bakashika mu munzhi wa Jenesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Alimwi bantu ba mu munzhi uyo, nibakamuzhiba Jesu, bakatuma bwaambilizhi kuminzhi yoonse izhingulukile. Amane bantu bakaleta balwazhi bonse kuli Jesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />alimwi bakamulomba kwaamba a zumizhe balwazhi ku jata kumbali a chikobela chakwe, alimwi oonse uyo wakachijata wakaponeshegwe.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Injiisho zha bashikale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maako 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ono bamwi bama Faliise aba maii ba mulawo, bakaza kuli Jesu kuzwa ku Jelusalema a kumubuzha ati, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Nkambo nzhi bashichiiya bako balatyola njiisho zhabashikale besu? Tabasambi kumaza chiindi nibayanda kulya!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nkambo nzhi nchimutyola mulawo wa Leza a ku chilila milawo yanu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Leza wakaamba ati, ‘Lemeka baiso a banyoko, alimwi oonse uyo ushinganya baishi abanyina ulyelele kufa.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Pesi imwe mulaamba ati, mfumbwa uyo waambilizha kwaamba nchakalikweelele kugwasha baishi abanyina ncha Leza,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Taelele kulemaka baishi a banyina anchicho. Nchichecho mulakaka ijwi lya Leza ankambo ka njiisho zhanu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Imwe nu bashikupaupa ameso! Anu Izaya wakalinga kululeme naa kashinshima kujatikizha ndimwe,<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />‘Aba bantu balandemeka a milomo yabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">pesi myoyo yabo ili kulaale andime.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Balankomba chabuyo, alimwi injiisho zhabo nzha milawo ya buntu.’<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zhintu zhipa muntu kusofana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maako 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Jesu wakaita mbunga ya bantu kuyaambila ati, “Amunve a kunvisha. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Chinjila mukanwa mwa muntu ta chimusofanzhi pesi chita chizwa mumoyo wakwe chichimusofazha.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Alimwi bashichiiya bakwe bakaza kuli nguwe a kumubuzha ati, “Saa mulizhi kwaamba ati, bama Faliisi bakakalala nibakanva ichi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, mfumbwa chisamu chitana kushangwa a Taata waku julu, chila kuzhulwa kushikila ku miyaanda. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />A mubaleke mbasololi boofu, Naa mooofu wasololela moofu nyiina bonse balawila mu chilindi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Petulo wakaamba ati, “Tupandulwile kaambyo aka nchikaamba.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Jesu wakababuzha ati, “Saa tamuchichite lushomo. <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />“Saa tamubwene kwaamba choonse chinjila mukanwa chilaya mumala amana chilazwa mumubili. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Pesi zhintu zhizwa mukanwa mwa muntu, zhila zwa mu moyo alimwi nzhi zhisofanya muntu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Nkambo kuzwa mu mumoyo mumuzwa mizezo ibibi, itola ku kujaya, kuchita bumambe, bwaamu, alimwi a zhintu zhitasalali, kubba a kubeja alimwi a kujayana mazhina. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Zhintu izhi nzhizhisofanya muntu, Pesi kulya kwakubula kusamba kumaza takusofanyi muntu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lushomo lwa mukaintu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maako 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Ono Jesu nakazwa kubusena ubo, wakaunka kuchishi cha Teli a Sidoni <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ono mukaintu wa mukenani wakalinga kukkala mu munzhi umo, wakaza kuli Jesu, kaalila ati, “Mwami, “Mwana Devedi!” Wakalila a kwaamba ati, “Nviile luzhalo ime, mwanagu mukaintu wanjilwa myuuya ibiibi alimwi uli muchimo chibiibi.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Pesi Jesu taaku nakamunviila naliba lizwi lyomwi, amane bashichiiya bakwe bakaza kuli nguwe a kulomba Jesu ati, “Amwaambile kuunka mukaintu, nkambo utotuyobekela a kutuchilila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Wakabanviila ati, “Ndakatumwabo ku mbelele nzhi sowekele, zha mu Izilaili.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Mukaintu wakaza a kufugama kuli Jesu, wakaamba ati, “Mwami mvune ime!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Wakanviila ati, “Tachili kabotu kubweza chinkwa chabaana a kusowela babwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />“Nchachobeni Mwami,” Wakanviila mukaintu, “Pesi abalo babwa balalya tulokaila kuzwa atebule yaba shimalelo abo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Amane Jesu wakaamba kulinguwe ati, “Uli mukaintu walushomo lunene! Kuyanda kwako kwapengwa.” Alimwi a chiindi awo mukaintu mwana akwe wakaponeshegwa.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya bantu baanji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Jesu nakazwa uko, wakaunka kumbali a lweenge lwa Galilaya, amane wakatanta atala a mulundu a kukkala anshi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mbunga ya bantu yakaza kuli nguwe akuletelezha balema a boofu, ba teendi, bachibuulu alimwi aba mwi balwazhi baanji a kubabika ku myeendo yaa Jesu, alimwi wakabaponya boonse. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Bantu bakakankamana nibakabona ba chibuulu kabaamba a batakali kweenda baponeshegwa, a balema kweenda alimwi a boofu kubona. Alimwi bakalumbaizha Leza wa Izilaili.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakasanina zhuulu zhone zha bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maako 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Jesu wakaita bashichiiya bakwe alimwi akwaamba, “Ndabanvila nkumbu bantu aba, nkambo bali adime kwamazuba otatwe ono, alimwi tabachite chakulya. Nshiyandi kubaleke ati baunke anzala boo, nkambo bamwi inga bawa kunzala banokujokela mu nzhila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakamubuzha ati, “Nkuli nkweshi tuule zhakulya zhakwaamba bantu aba balye muno munkanda?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Jesu wakababuzha ati, “Ino mulichite zhinkwa zhongaye?” bakanviila ati, “zhili chiloba a tuswi tumwi tushoonto.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Amane Jesu wakaambila mbunga ya bantu kukkala anshi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Ono wakabweza zhinkwa zhili chiloba atuswi, A kupa kulumba kuli Leza. Amane wazhikomaunakomauna a kupa bashichiiya, balo bakapa bantu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bakalya bonse akukuta, amane bashichiiya bakanyamuna mitaanga izwile yazhakulya zhakashala ili chiloba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Ono basankwa bakalya, bakalinga zhuulu zhone, kutabalilizha a bamakaintu a baana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ono Jesu nakamana kulazhana a mbunga ya bantu, Wakanjiila mu bwaato a kunka kuchishi cha Magadala.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Bakayanda kubona maleele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maako 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luuka 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bama Faliisi a ba Sadukki bakaza kuli Jesu kwaamba bamusole. kubatondezha chitondezho kuzwa ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Pesi Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Chiindi chamangolezha mulaamba ati, ‘Bulacha kabotu, nkambo ku julu kulasalala.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Alimwi kuseeni mulaamba ati, ‘Sunu kuli muwo nkambo ku julu takusalali kulashiya mbi.’ Mulizhi kupandulula mbonekelo ya ku julu, Pesi mulalilwa kupandulula zhitondezho zha chiindi chasunu. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Musela ubiibi uyu a bumambe, ulalomba chitondezho, pesi taaku chitondezho ncheshi mukapengwe, kunze boo kwachitondezho cha Joona,” Amana Jesu wakaunka akubashiya.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamena aba Faliisi aba Sadukki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maako 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Bashichiiya nibakazubukila kutala a lweenge lwa Galilaya, bakaluba kubweza chinkwa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Jesu wakaabambila ati, “Amuchenjele a mamena aba Faliisi aba Sadukki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bakatalika kwaamba mu lwabo lwabo ati, “Nkambo taaku twaleta chinkwa chili choonse.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ono mukuzhiba nchibakalinga kwaamba, Jesu wakababuzha ati, “Imwe nu bantu balushomo lushoonto, nkambo nzhi mulalyambouzha mulwanu lwanu kwaamba tamuchite chinkwa? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Saa ambuli sunu tamunvishi? Saa tamuyeeyi kwaamba zhinkwa zhosanwe ndakasanina bantu bakalinga zhuulu zhosanwe alimwi bakazuzha mitaanga ili chiloba ya manyonvelele? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Naa kuzwa muzhinkwa zhili chiloba ndakasanina bantu bali zhuulu zhone, alimwi mwakabwezelela mitaanga yongaye? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Ino mbuti mbumutazhi kwaamba nshindali kwaamba achinkwa kulindimwe? Pesi amuchenjele a mimena yaba Faliisi alimwi a Basadukki!” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Ono bakanva kwaamba taakali kubachenjezha a mimena isebenzhegwa mu chinkwa, Pesi wakali kwaamba njiisho zha ba Falisi aba Sadukki.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo wakazubulula kwaamba Jesu ngu Massiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maako 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luuka 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Ono Jesu nakashika muchishi cha Sizaliya Filipi, wakabuzha bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Ino bantu balaamba Mwana a Muntu nguni?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bakanviila ati, “Bamwi balaamba Joni mubbizhi, bamwi balaamba Elija. Alimwi bamwi balaamba nduwe Jelemiya naa umwi waba shinshimi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Wakabuzha ati, “Ino imwe mulaamba ndime nii?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Saimoni Petulo wakanviila ati, “Ndiwe Mesiya Mwana a Leza upona.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Ulilelekelwe iwe Saimoni Mwana Joona!” Nkambo taaku nii chakazubululwa kulindiwe mu buntu pesi kwiinda muli Taata wa ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Alimwi ndakwaambila kwaamba ndiwe Petulo, alimwi alibwe ili ndakuyaka chikombelo changu alimwi lufu talukachikonzhi kuchizunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Ndaakukupa makki a bwami bwa ku Julu. mfumbwa chimwanga anshi a ku Julu changwa, alimwi mfumbwa chimwangulula anshi a ku julu changululwa,”<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Amane Jesu wakaambila bashichiya bakwe ati, bataambili Muntu uli oonse kwaamba ngu Messiya.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaamba a kupenga kwakwe a lufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maako 8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luuka 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Kuzwa ku chiindi incho Jesu wakatalika kupandulwila bashichiiya bakwe, Kwaamba ulyelele kunka ku Jelusalema a kupenzhegwa ku zhintu zhiinji mumaanza a bamaalu, aba paizhi banene a bamaii ba mulawo, alimwi ulyelele kujaigwa alimwi buzuba bwatatu ulakubuzhigwa kuzwa kubafu.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Amane Petulo wakamutola Jesu ambali a kutalika kumubwekela, “Tachikachitiki inchi kuli ndiwe Mwami!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Jesu wakasanduluka a kumwambila Petulo ati, “Zwa kulindime Satani! Nkambo uli chilebyo kuli ndime, alimwi mizeezo yako taizwi kuli Leza pesi nja buntu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Amane Jesu wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Mfumbwa uyanda kuba shichiiya wangu ulyelele kushiya milimo yakwe, akubweza chichingano chakwe a kuchinchilila. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Nkambo mfumbwa uyandishisha mbuumi bwakwe, ulakubusowekelwa, pesi uyo usowekelwa buumi bwakwe a nkambo kandime, ulakubujana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ino mbulumbu nzhi bujanika naa Muntu wavuba nyika yoonse amane wasowekelwa buumi bakwe? Taaku nchinga wapa kujola buumi bwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Nkambo Mwana Muntu ulakuza mubulemu bwa baishi alimwi abangele bakwe, alimwi a kupa bulumbu ku Muntu oonse kwendelana a milimo yakwe njakachita. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Kashimpe ndamwabila, bamwi bainvi ano tabakafi kushikila bakabone Mwana Muntu kaza mu Bwami bwakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">kuchinchululwa kwa chiwa cha Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maako 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luuka 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ono nikwakainda mazuba ali chisambomwi Jesu wakabweza Petulo a Jemusi a Joni mukwabo Jemusi, a kubatola a mulundu ulaafu uko nkubakaba boo beenka <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Uko nkwakachinchululwa chiwa Jesu chakaboneka mbuli lizuba, a zhalo zhakusama zhakwe zhakaboneka kutuba anga mumuni. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Kabachilangilila bashichiiya, bakabona Elija alimwi a Mozesi kababandika a Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Amane Petulo wakaambila Jesu ati, “Mwami, nchibotu iswe kuba kuno. Naa koyanda, inga ndabika zhivuka zhotatwe chomwi chaako chomwi cha Mozesi alimwi chomwi cha Elija.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Ono kachaamba boo, likumbi limweka lyakabavumba, alimwi lizwi lyakaamba kuzwa mulikumbi, “Uyu ngu Mwanangu musankwa walo uyo ngu nyanda, muli nguwe ndakomana. kamu munviila!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ono bashichiiya nibakanva ichi, bakawa anshi chakuvuntama. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Pesi Jesu wakaza a kubajata. Wakabaambila ati, “Amunyamuke,” “Mutatiji.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ono nibakalungumana taaku ngubakabona kunze kwa Jesu boo eenka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Nibakalinga kuselemuka kuzwa a mulundu, Jesu wakabaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Mutaambili uli oonse nchimwabona, kushikila Mwana a Muntu a kabushigwe kuzwa kubafu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Bashichiiya bakwe bakamubuzha Jesu ati, “Nkambo nzhi ba maii ba mulawo balaamba ati Elija ulyelele kutaanguna kuza?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Nchachobeni Elija ulakutaanguna kuza alimwi ulakubamba zhintu zhoonse. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Pesi ndamwambila, Elija wazakale alimwi tabana kumuzhiba bantu, pesi bakachita kuli nguwe zhoonse zhibayanda. Munzhila yeenka Mwana a Muntu balakumupenzha.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Amane bashichiiya bakanva kwaamba Jesu wakalinga kubaambila makani a Joni mubbizhi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya Mwaana musankwa wakali kuchite myuuya ibiibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maako 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luuka 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ono nibakaza ku mbunga ya bantu, umwi Muntu wakaza kuli Jesu a kufungama. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />“Alimwi wakaamba ati, “Muii, munviile luzhalo mwanaangu! Ngu shikashiita alimwi ulapenzhegwa maningi, zhimwi zhiindi ulawila mumulilo naa mumanzhi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ndakamuleta ku bashichiiya bako pesi bakalilwa kumuponya.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Imwe nubayumu myoyo alimwi nimutashomi! Ndakkala chiindi chilaafu buti andimwe? Alimwi ndamupengela chiindi chilaafu buti? Amumuleta Mwana musankwa uyo kuli ndime.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Amane Jesu wakautanda muuya ubiibi, peenka peenka mwaana musankwa wakaponezhegwa.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Bamane bashichiiya bakwe bakaza chakuyubilila a kumubuzha ati, “Nkambo nzhi twakaalilwa kugusha myuuya ibiibi?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Nkambo mulichite lushomo lushoonto. Kashimpe ndamwambila, nakamuchite lushomo mbuli lwa nseke yamasitadi, inga mwaambila mulundu uyu ati, ‘Zwa zhuka awa uunke kuya,’ alimwi inga weenda akumunvila. Taaku ncheshi mukaalilwe imwe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Pesi nkupaila boo akuliimya kwiinga kwagusha myuuya ibiibi iyi, taaku chimbi.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaamba makani a lufu lwakwe chiindi chabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maako 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luuka 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ono chiindi nibakaza antomwi mu Galilaya, wakabaambila ati, “Mwana a Muntu ula kwaabwa mumanza a Bantu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Bala kumujaya, alimwi mubuzuba bwatatu ulakubushigwa kuzwa kubafu.” Amane bashichiiya bakwe bakakalala maningi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mitelo ya tempele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ono Jesu a bashichiiya bakwe nibakashika mu Kapenaumu, bashi mitelo ba tempele bakaza kuli Petulo a kubuzha ati, “Saa muii wanu ulapa mitelo ya tempele?” <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />“Eeye Wakanviila Petulo. Chiindi Petulo kachili mu ng'anda Jesu wakamubuzha kutanguna ati, “Ino wayeeya buti Saimoni? Ino nkuli bamii ba nyika nkubabweza mitelo? Saa nkubana babo naa ku bantu boo?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Petulo wakanviila ati, “Kuli bamwi,” “Nkukwaamba baana tabapi mitelo,” Jesu wakamwaambila ati. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />“Nkambo tatuyandi kuba a mulandu ku bantu aba, kounka ku mulonga uwaale kanzabwe kako mu maanzhi. Inswi njeshi ujate kutaaguna, waijalula mulomo ulajana maali a kabulo, waabweze uunke ukape mutelo wako a waangu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Nguni munene mubwami bwaku Julu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maako 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luuka 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ku chiindi icho bashichiiya bakaza kuli Jesu a kubuzha ati, “Ino nguni munene mu Bwami bwaku julu?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Amane Jesu wakaita mwaana akumuimika kumpela kwabo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />“Kashimpe ndamwaabila, namutachinchi a kuba mbuli mwaana mushoonto, tamukabuboni Bwami bwaku Julu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Munene mu Bwami bwaku julu ngoyo uli cheesha a kuba mbuli mwaana mushoonto. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Alimwi oonse uyo utambula mwaana mushoonto uli mbuli uyu mu liina lyangu watambula ndime.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masunko ku chinyonyono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maako 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luuka 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />“Ono naa umwi walengesha kwaamba aba baana bashoonto bashoma mulindime kubisha, nchibotu uyo muntu kumwaangilila libwe linene mushingo amane akumuwaala mu mulonga ulaamfu kwaamba wanwina. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Mawe kunyika nkambo kazhintu zhipa bantu kusowakelwa lushomo lwabo! Zhintu inzho zhilanochitika boo lyoonse, Pesi mawe kuli uyo uchitisha kwaamba zhichitike!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />“Ono lyaanza naa mweendo wako ulakulengesha kusowekelwa lushomo lwako, lizutule a kulisowa! Nchibotu kunjila mu buumi butamani kotashite lyaanza naa mweendo, kwiinda kuba a maanza a myeendo akuwaalwa mukalambwe ka mulilo. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Alimwi naa liinso lilakupa kusowekelwa lushomo lwako, ligushe a kulisowa! Nchibotu kunjila mu buumi butamani a liinso lyomwe kwiinda kusowelwa mu gehena a menso obilo.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo ka mbelele isowekele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luuka 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />“Amubone kwaamba mwatanyonganya baana bashoonto aba. Ndamwaabila bangele babo balabona bushu bwa Taata ku julu lyoonse. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Nkambo Mwana a Muntu wakaza kufutula basowekele <verse eid="MAT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Ino mulayeeye buti? Naa muntu kachite mbelele zhili myaanda, amana yomwi mbelele yasoweka, saa ingatazhishiyi zhili makkumi mfuka kazhilya mu malundu, a kuunka mukulangaula yomwi isowekele <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Alimwi naa waijana, kashimpe ndamwaabila ulakomana nkambo kambelele yomwi kwinda zhili makkumi mfuka zhitana kusoweka. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Munzhila yenka ishi wanu uli Mukati ka Julu tayandi kwaamba bana bashonto aba basoweke.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbutuyandika kuchita bakwesu naa batubishila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Naa mukwanu wakulubizhila, kounka kuli nguwe umutondezha chibibi chakwe, kamuli boo nobilo. Naa wakunvila nishi wamujola muzhila iluleme. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Pesi nawakaka kukunvila, bweza omwi naa bobilo bantu kwaamba ati, ‘Mfumbwa mazwi eshi a bandikwe anvike a bakamboni bobilo naa botatwe,’ <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Alimwi nawakaka kunva, ono ambila makani onse ku chikombelo. Alimwi naa wakaka kunvila chikombelo, kamumuleka abe mbuli wamanshi naa shimitelo.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukashigwa a kuzuminizhigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Alimwi ndamwaabila ati, mfumbwa nchimwaanga anshi ano aku julu chaangwa, alimwi mfumbwa chimwaangulula anshi ano aku julu chaangululwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Kashimpe ndamwaabila ati, naa bobilo bantu anshi a nyika bazumizhana chintu chimwi a kuchipailila, chilakupegwa kuli mbabo a Taata waku julu. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Nkambo mfumbwa uko nkubabungana bobilo naa botatwe mu liina lyangu, ndi ambabo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kamusebenzhi wakakaka kulekelela mwezhinyina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Petulo wakaza kuli Jesu a kumubuzha ati, “Mwami, zhiindi zhongaye zhinjelele kumulekelela mukwesu naa wandubizhila? Saa zhiindi zhili chiloba?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Kashimpe ndakwaambila ati, Kutaashi zhiindi zhili chiloba boo, pesi zhiindi zhili makkumi chiloba a chiloba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Nkambo Bwami bwa ku julu buli mbuli mwami wakaita basebenzhi bakwe boonse kwaamba bajole zhikwelete zhakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ono nakatalika boo kusesa zhikwelete, umwi wabasebenzhi wakabweza maali aanji wakaletegwa ku mwami. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Mbukuli takalinga kuchikonzha kujola nkongole, ba shemalelo bakwe ba kalailila kwaamba, walo a bakaintu bakwe a baana bakwe a zhoonse nzhibachite zhulishigwe kwaamba nkongole ijoke. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Amane nakanva musebenzhi wakafungama kumpela lya shimalelo akwe akulomba ati, ‘Ndakomba a mupeko boo chiindi chishoonto, ndakuijola nkongole yoonse!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ono shimalelo akwe nakamulanga wakamunvila luse, amane wakamulekelela nkongole yakwe akumwaambila ati auunke.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Amane musebenzhi nakaunka ansengwe wakajana musebenzhi mweenzhinyina kaeenda munzhila, wakalinga kuchite nkongole ya maali ashoonto boo. Wakamujata mweezhinyina a kutalika kumushina, ‘Kaamba ati zhola maali nguwaka kongola kuli ndime,’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Musebenzhi mweezhinyina wakafungama, ‘Wakaamba ndalomba mpeko boo chiindi chishoonto ndakujolela nkongole yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Pesi wakakaka, wakaunka aku mubika mutolongo kushikila nkongole yoonse akaijole. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ono basebenzhi beenzhinyina nibakabona chakachitika, bakakalala maningi a kuunka kwaambila shimalelo abo zhoonse zhakachitika. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />“Amane shimalelo wakaita musebenzhi uyo akwaamba ati, ‘Iwe umusebezhi mubiibi,’ wakaamba, ‘Ndakakulekelela nkongole njiwakalinga kuchite kuli ndime yoonse, nkambo wakanoomba. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Wakalikwelele komunvila luzhalo mweezhinyoko bweenka mbundakunvila luzhalo.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Alimwi shemalelo wakwe wakakalala maningi, amane wakamuwaala mutolongo musebenzhi wakwe kwaamba asubulwe, kushikila akajole mweelwe wa nkongole yoonse. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Amane Jesu wakaamba ati, “Mbweshi akamuchite Taata waku julu, uyo oonse utalekeleli mukwabo kuzwa anshi a moyo wakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaisha makani a kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maako 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ono Jesu nakamana kwaamba zhintu izhi, wakazwa ku Galilaya akuunka ku chishi cha Judaya kuzubuka lumwi lubazu lwa Jodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Imbunga ya bantu yakamuchilila, alimwi wakabaponya kuya.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ono Bamwi bama Faliisi bakaza kuli Jesu mukumusola kwiinda mu mubuzho ati, “Saa chili mu mulawo musankwa kuleka mukaintu wakwe nkambo katwambo tuli toonse?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Ono Jesu wakanviila ati, “Saa tamuna kubala malembe amba ati, kumatalikilo mulengi wakalenga musankwe a mukaintu? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Alimwi wakaamba ati, ‘A nkambo kachechi musankwa ulakushiya baishi a banyina akukakatila mukaintu wakwe alimwi bobilo aba ilakuba nyama yomwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Tabachili bobilo pesi nyama yomwi. Taaku muntu welele kwandanya incho Leza nchakabika atomwi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Jesu bakamubuzha ba Faliisi ati, “Nkambo nzhi, Mozesi wakapa mulawo musankwa wakupa mukaintu wakwe chipepa chakulekana, amana a kumutanda?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Jesu wakabambila ati, “Mozesi wakamuzumizha kuleka ba makaintu banu, nkambo myoyo yanu njiyumu. Pesi tabushi mbuchakalinga kuzwa kumatalikilo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Ndamwaabila uyo oonse uleka mukaintu wakwe, kunze kwa bwaamu, alimwi naa wakwata mukaintu umbi nkukwaamba wachita chimaambe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Bashichiiya bakamwambila Jesu ati, “Ono anu naa mbuchibele ubo nchibotu musankwa a mukaintu kutakwata,”<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Tabashi boonse biinga bazumina makani aya, pesi chita boo abo mbulya kapegwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kuli twaambo tupusene pusene bamasankwa nchibatakwatili, bamwi mbubakazhalwa alimwi nkambo bamwi bakazibwa abantu, alimwi bamwi tabakwati nkambo ka Bwami bwa ku julu. Anu uyo onse wiinga wakonzha kuchilila njiisho iyi achite bweenka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaleleka baana bashoonto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maako 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luuka 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Bamwi bantu bakaleta baana bashoonto kuli Jesu kwaamba abajate maanza akwe akuba pailila, pesi balo bashichiiya bakababwekela. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Amubaleke baana bashoonto baze kuli ndime alimwi mutabakashi nkambo Bwami bwaku julu mbubwabo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ono nakamana kubika maanza alimbabo, wakazwa ko.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musankwa muvubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maako 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luuka 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ono chiindi icho umwi musankwa wakaza kuli Jesu a kubuzha ati, “O Muii, nchizhi chibotu nchiinga ndachita kwaamba tambule buumi butamani?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />“Nkambo nzhi mulambuzha kujatikizha chili kabotu?” Jesu wakanviila ati. “Kuli boo omwi ulikabotu. Naulanda kunjila buumi butamani, baamba milawo.<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Wakabuzha ati, “Ili milawo?” Jesu wakanviila ati, “Utajayi, Utachiti chimambe, utabbi, utapi bukamboni bwakubeja, <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />lemeka baiso a banyoko alimwi yanda mwenzhinyoko mbuli mboli yanda.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />musankwa muvubi wakaamba ati, “Yoonse iyi milawo ndakaibamba,” “Nchinzhi chimbi nchingelele kuchita?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Nakoyanda kululama, kounka uuzhe lubono lwako loonse, wamana upe kubachete, ulakuba a buvube ku julu, amane uze unchilile.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Musankwa muvubi nakanva makani aya, wakaunka kausile nkambo wakalinga kuvubile maningi.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Amane Jesu wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, “Kashimpe ndamwaabila, nchiyumu muntu muvubi kunjila mu Bwami bwa ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Alimwi ndamwaabila, nchuubu ku nkamela kunjila mukalyango ka Nyeleti kwiinda muntu muvubi kunjila mu bwami bwa ku ulu bwa Leza.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ono bashichiiya nibakanva ichi, bakakankamana alimwi a kubuzha ati, “Anu ono nguni wiinga wafutuka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Jesu wakabalanga amane waamba ati, “Ku muntu tachikonzheki, pesi kuli Leza zhintu zhoonse zhila konzheka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Petulo wakamunviila ati, “Kolanga,” waakamba ati, “Twakashiya zhintu zhoonse a kukuchilila, ino ulakutupa nzhi iswe?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Kashimpe ndamwaabila, chiindi zhintu zhoonse zhakubambululwa kuba zhipya, chiindi Mwana a Muntu a kukkala achuna chakwe chabulemu, andimwe nuba chilili bangu mulakukkala a zhuna zhili kkumi azhobilo, a kubeteka mishobo ilikkumi a yobili ya bana ba Izilaili. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Alimwi onse uyo washiya maanda naa mukwabo naa mukwabo mukaintu naa banyina naa baishi naa baana, naa bakaintu bakwe amyunda nkambo kangu, ulakutambula bulumbu buli myaanda buunji a kupegwa buumi butamani. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Pesi banji bali kumpela balakuba muunshi, alimwi bali muunshi blakuba kumpela.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Basebenzhi mumuunda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />“Bwami bwaku julu buli mbuli mwiine muunda, wakaunka chiindi chakuseni seni kunjizha basebenzhi mu muunda wakwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Bakazumizhana kubapa siliva ya lubulo yomwi abuzuba, amane wakabatuma kunka mukusebenza mumuunda wakwe.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Nikwakakasala chiindi lizuba nili yasa nkuumo (muma 9 koloko) wakaunka alimwi wakabona bambi kabainvi mumasena a kusambalila kabatachite chakuchita. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Wakabambila ati, ‘Muunke mukasebenze mu muunda wangu andimwe, ndamupa bulumbu bwelele.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Amana bakaunka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">“Alimwi chiindi chamalumwi wakaunka alimwi mangolesha wakachita bweenka. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Alimwi kachiya kumangolezha chakuma (5 koloko) wakaunka, wajana bambi kabainvi kabatachite chakuchita. Wakababuzha ati, ‘Nkambo nzhi muliinvi buzuba boonse kutaku chimutekuchita?’<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />“Nkambo taaku watunjizha nchito, bakanviila. ‘Wakabaambila kamunka andimwe musebenze mu muunda wangu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Ono chiindi nichakashika ku mangolezha, mwiine muunda wakaambila musebezhi wakwe munene, ‘Baite basebenzhi boonse ubape bulumbu bwabo, utalikile kupa bakashalizha kunjila, wamana upe bakataanguna kunjila.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Basebenzhi abo bakanjizhigwa chiindi kachiya kumangolezha bakapegwa siliva ya lubulo yomwi yomwi boonse. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ono abo bakajinzhigwa chiindi chakuseni seni nibakaza, balo bakayeya kwaamba balapegwa maali anji. Pesi a balo bakapegwa bulumbu bweenka bwa siliva yomwi yomwi ya lubulo. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Nibakamana kutambula, bakatalika kutongaukila mwiine muunda. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Bakaamba ati, ‘Aba banjizhigwa kumamanino alimwi basebenza boo chiindi chishoonto, alimwi bapegwa bulumbu bwelene andiswe nitwasebenza nchito inene alimwi alumwi lwatubala!’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Mwiine muunda wakamunviila umwi ati, ‘Nshina kukuchenga umweenzuma. Mwakazumina kusebenzela abuzuba siliva yomwi yomwi ya lubulo. <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Bweza maali ako uunke. Ndanda kupa uyu muntu ngu ndanjizha kumamanino bulumbu bweenka mbundapa kuli ndiwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Saa nshichite nguzu zhakusebenzha maali angu mbuli mbunyanda? Naa wanva munyono nkambo ndapa chakwanguluka?”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />“Ono bali kumpela balakuba muunshi, alimwi bali muunshi balakuba kumpela.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaamba zha lufu lwakwe chiindi chatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maako 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luuka 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ono Jesu nakalinga kuunka ku Jelusalema, munzhila, wakababweza bashichiiya bakwe bali kkumi abobilo ambali a kubambila ati, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Tulaunka ku Jelusalema, kwalo uko Mwana a Muntu nkweshi akaabwe kubapaizhi aku ba mii ba mulawo. Balo balakumupa mulandu walufu, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />akumwaaba mu maanza a ba Mashi balo bashi bakamusampaule, kumukwipa akumugagaila achichingano. Amana mu buzuba bwa tatu ulakubuka kuzwa kubafu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulomba kwabanyina Joni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maako 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ono bamuka Zebediya bakaza kuli Jesu a banababo basankwa bobilo, amane a kufungama kuli nguwe a kumulomba lugwasho.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Jesu wakamubuzha ati, “Ulanda nzhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Wakanviila ati, “Nshomezhe kwaamba bana bangu aba bobilo, umwi akakkale kulyanza lyako lyakululyo alimwi umwi akakkale kulyanza lyako lyakulumweshi mubulelo bwako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Tamuzhi nchimulomba,” “Saa inga mwanwa nkapu yamapenzhi njeshi nkanwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">bakanviila ati, “Inga twanwa,”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Jesu wakambambila ati, “Nchachobeni mulaakunwa ku nkapu yangu, Pesi kukkala kululyo naa kulumweshi taashi nguzu zhangu zha kusala. Aya masena nga ababo Taata mbakabambila.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ono bashichiiya bakalinga kkumi nibakanva makani aya, bakatondezha kukalala kubakwabo abo bobilo. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Amane Jesu wakabaita boonse waamba ati, “Mulizhi kwaamba abo baitwa kuba bendelezhi babamashi balalyendelezha bene, alimwi bamasololi babo banene balilichite nguzu kubasololela. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Kutaashi kuli ndimwe. Anu uli oonse uyanda kuba munene akati kanu ulyelele kuba musebenzhi wanu, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />alimwi uyo oonse uyanda kutanguna, ulyelele kuba musebenzhi wanu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Bweenka mbuli Mwana a Muntu mbwatakaza mukusebenzelwa pesi kusebenza, akulipila buumi bwakwe kuba lawakwangulula lwakufutula bantu baanji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaponya boofu bobilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maako 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luuka 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Mbuli Jesu abashichiiya bwakwe nibakalinga kweenda kuzwa ku Jeliko. Alimwi a bashichiiya bakwe, imbunga ya bantu yakabachilila. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ono basankwa boofu bobilo, bakali kukkala mumbali a nzhila nibakanva ati Jesu utokwiinda, bakoolobezha, “Mwami, Mwana a Devedi tunvile luzhalo iswe!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Imbunga ya bantu yakababwekela a kubambila, a mumune, pesi balo bakaindilizha koolobezha, “Mwami, Mwana Devedi tunvile luzhalo iswe!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Amane Jesu wakaimikana a kubaita. “Ino mulanda muchitilenzhi?” wakababuzha.<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />bakanviila ati, “Mwami,” tulanda kubona.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Jesu wakabanvila luse amane wakajata menso abo, peenka penka bakalanga a kumuchilila.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakanjila mu Jelusalema chakuzunda.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maako 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luuka 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Ono nibakashika kufaafi a Jelusalema, alimwi ku Betefage ku muluundu wa Oliva, Jesu wakatuma bashichiiya bakwe bobilo, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />wakabaambila ati, “Kamuunka ku munzhi uli kumpela lyanu, alimwi mulajana mbongolo akana mbongolo kayangilwe, muzhangulule a kuzhileta kuli ndime <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Alimwi mfumbwa eshi amubuzhe, mumwambile kwaamba, ‘Mwami ulazhinyanda, alimwi ulazhileke peenka penka.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ichi chakachitika kuzuzikizha chakaambwa kwiinda mu mushinshimi,<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />“Ambila munzhi wa Ziyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‘langa, Mwami wako waza kuli ndiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">walibombya alimwi wakwela akambongolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">alimwi akambongolo, akana ambongolo.<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ono bashichiiya bakaunka a kuchita bweenka bwakabalailila Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bakaileta mbongolo a mwana njiyo, a kutalika kuwaala zhikobela zhabo alinzhizho kwaamba akkalewo Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mabunga abantu a kayala zhikobela zhabo munzhila alimwi bamwi bakalinga kuyala tusaanzu munzhila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Abo bakalinga kweenda kumpela lyakwe ababo bakalinga kumuchilila muunshi, bakatalika koolobezha akulumbaizha ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:9">“Alumbaizhigwe Mwana Devedi! “Ulilelekelwe uyo uza mu liina lya Mwami!” Alumbaizhigwe uli ku julu!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ono Jesu nakanjila mu Jelusalema, onse munzhi wakakankamana a kubuzha ati, “Ino nguni uyu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mbunga ya bantu yakanviila, ngu Jesu mushinshimi kuzwa ku Nazaleti mu munzhi wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatanda bashikuuzha Mu tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maako 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luuka 19.45-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Ono Jesu wakanjila mu lubaanza lwa tempele a kutanda boonse bakalinga kuula a kuuzha. Wakatingamuna matebulu a bakalinga kuchinchishana maali azhuna zhababo bakalinga kuuzha nkwilimba. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Wakabaambila ati, “Chililembelwe,” Leza wakaamba ati, ‘Ng'anda yangu ilakwitwa kwaamba nii ng'anda yakupailila,’ Pesi imwe mwachita kuba ‘Chiyubilo chabakabwala!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Alimwi boofu a balema bakaza kuli nguwe mu Tempele, amane wakabaponya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Pesi ba paizhi banene alimwi a ba maii bamulawo nibakabona zhintu zhibotu Jesu nzhakachita, a bana mbuli mbubakalinga koolobezha mu lubaanza lwa tempele akwaamba ati, “Alumbaizhigwe Mwana Devedi,” balo chakabachima.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Jesu bakamubuzha ati “Saa ulinvile bana bashoonto nchibate kwaamba?” Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Mbumbubo,” Saa tamunakubala ko malembe aya?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Kuzwa ku milomo ya baana aya twana tuchinyonka, iwe o Leza waita kutembaulwa kwako?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Amane Jesu wakabashiya a kuunka ku munzhi wa Betani nkwakaunka koona.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakashinganya chisamu cha mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maako 11.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Chiindi chakuseni seni mbuli Jesu mbwakali kujokela ku munzhi wakanva nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nakabona chisamu chamukuyu kumbali a nzhila, amane wakaunka kulinchicho pesi taaku nchakajana kunze boo kwamateu. Amane wakaamba kuli nchicho, “Tokazhali michelo alimwi!” Peenka penka chisamu chakayuma.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Bashichiiya nibakabona icho, bakakankama akubuzha, “Nkambo nzhi chisamu cha mukuyu ichi chayuma kufambana?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Kashimpe ndamwaambila, nakamuchite lushomo lwakutajoka muunshi, inga mwachita chiinda chachitika ku chisamu cha mukuyu uyu. Pesi kutaashi boo ubo, inga mwachikonzha kwaambila mulundu uyu kwaamba, ‘Kounka, ‘Liwaale mu lweenge,’ alimwi chilakonzha kuchitika. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Naa kamushoma mulakonzha kutambula mfumbwa nchimwalomba mu mupailo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakabuzhigwa nguzu zhakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maako 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luuka 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Jesu wakanjila mu lubaanza lwa tempele, mbuli mbwakalinga kuiisha ba paizhi banene a bamaalu bakaza kuli nguwe a kubuzha, “Twaambile ninguzu nzhi nzhochite zhakuchita zhintu zhoonse izhi? “Alimwi nguni wakakupa nguzu zhakuchita zhintu izhi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Jesu wakanviila, “Andime ndamubuzha boo mubuzho omwi. Naa munviile, ndamwambila wakampa nguzu zhakuchita zhintu izhi. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Ono kubbizha kwa Joni kwakazwa ku Julu naa ku muntu?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Alimwi bakatalika kulyambuzha kwaamba, “Naa twaambe, “Kwakazwa ku julu,’ ulaamba ati, ‘Ino nkambo nzhi taaku mwakamushoma Joni?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Pesi naa twaambe ati, “Ku muntu?’ Bakatija bantu, nkambo boonse bakalinga kushoma kwaamba Joni wakalinga mushinshimi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Ono bakamunviila Jesu ati, “Tatuzhi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Amane wakabaambilanati, “Andime teshi mwaambile umpa nguzu zhakuchite zhintu izhi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo ka baana basankwa bobilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />“Ino, mulayeeya buti? Kwakalinga muntu wakalinga kuchite baana basankwa bobilo. Wakaunka ku wakataanguna a kumwaambaila ati, ‘Mwanangu, kounka ukasebenze mu muunda wangu sunu. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwaana wakaamba ati, nshaandi,’ pesi nikwakainda chiindi wakayeeya bumbi wakaunka mukusebenza. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Amane baishi bakaunka ku mwaana umbi akumwaambila bweenka mbuli wakutaanguna. Wakanviila ati ndaunka, ‘mwami, pesi tanakauunka. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />“Nguni a bantu bobilo aba wakachita chakalinga kuyanda baishi?” bakanviila kwaamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Wakutaanguna,” Amane Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Kashimpe ndamwaabila, bashimitelo a bamavuule bala kunjila mu bwami bwaku julu kumpela kwanu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Abobo Joni wakaza kumutondezha nzhila yabululami pesi tamuna kumushoma, balo bamavuule a bashimitelo bakamushoma. Alimwi nakuba kwaamba mwakabona ubo, takunimwakasanduka a kumushoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kabalindi ba muunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maako 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luuka 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Amunve ku kaambyo akamwi, kwakalinga mulimi wakalima muunda wamasansa akuyakila lukwakwa, washa chiliindi chakutyanina masansa, amane wakayaka a ng'anda yashikulindilila. Wakaupa bashikulindila, amane wakaunka kuchishi chimbi. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Chiindi nichakashika chakutebula masansa, wakatuma basebenzhi bakwe ku balimi kwaamba atambule chimpazha chakwe chamasansa.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Pesi balindilili bamasansa bakamujata musebenzhi a kumuuma, awalo umwi bakamuuma kumujaya amane watatu bakamuuma mabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Alimwi wakatuma basebenzhi bamwi banji kwiinda bakutanguna pesi abalo bakabachita bweenka. mubabashita kubenzhinyina. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Nkumamanino wakatuma mwana akwe waamba ati, ‘Kashimpe balamulemeka mwanaangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Pesi balimi bakaambilana kwaamba, ‘Uyu ngushikulya liina. Amuze, tumujaye, amana muunda ulaba wesu, <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Penka awo bakamujata akumujaya, amana bakamusowela kunze amuunda.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Amane Jesu wakabuzha ati, “Ino mwiine muunda akuza ula kubachita buti balimi?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />“Kashimpe ulakubajaya balimi babiibi aba,” bakanviila ati, “Alimwi ula kuupa balimi bambi muundu abo beshi bakamupe masansa a chiindi chakutebula.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Saa tamuna kubala malembe aamba ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Libwe lyakakakwa abayaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">lyakaba libwe lishomwa kwiinda onse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ichi chakachitwa a Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">alimwi nchibotu mumenso esu!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />“Alimwi ndamwaambila kwaamba bwami bwa Leza bulakubwezegwa kuli ndimwe a kupegwa ku bantu beshi bakazhale michelo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Uyo oonse uwila alibwe awa, ulakupasauka alimwi oonse ngweshi likalokele lilakumupasaula.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ono bama Faliisi a ba paizhi nibakanva twaambyo twa Jesu, bakazhiba kwaamba wakalinga kwaamba mbabo <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Bakalinga kulangaula nzhila yakumwangilamo, pesi tabana kuchikonzha nkambo bakalikutija mbunga ya bantu yakalinga kuzhi kwaamba ngu mushinshimi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Kaambyo ka pobwe lya bwiinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luuka 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Jesu wakabaambila mu twaambyo ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Bwami bwaku julu buli mbuli mwami wakapangila mwanakwe pobwe lya bwiinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Wakatuma basebenzhi bakwe kwiita boonse abo bakatambwa ku pobwe, pesi bakakaka kuza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Alimwi wakatuma basebenzhi bambi waamba ati, “Amubaambile abo batambilwe kwaamba zhakulya zhabambwa ono. Basune bangu a abombe bainine bajaigwa kale, zhoonse zhabambwa kale. Kamuza ku pobwe lya bwiinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Pesi taaku nibakamunvila, aumwi wakaunka ku munda alimwi aumwi wakaukna kumpindu zhakwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Amane bambi bakashaala bakabajata basebenzhi akubauma alimwi a kubajaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mwami nakanva wakakalala, wakatuma bashikalumamba bakwe akujaya bajai abo akutenta minzhi yabo yoonse. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Amane wakaambila basebenzhi bakwe kwamba, “Pobwe lya bwiinga lyabambwa ono, pesi bantu bakatambwa tabana kuza. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Kamuunka mu mazhila mutambe bantu baanji ku pobwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Ono basebenzhi bakaunka mu minzhi akubuganya bantu boonse mbubakajana, batakalinga kabotu a bakalinga kabotu. Amane ng'anda ya bwiinga yakazula beenzu yoonse.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Pesi Mwami nakanjila kubona beenzu, wakabona musankwa watakalinga kusamina chisani cha bwiinga. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Wakamubuzha ati, ‘Umweenzuma wanjila buti muno kotachite chisani cha bwiinga?’ Pesi musankwa wakabula chakwaamba. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Amane Mwami wakaambila basebezhi bakwe ati, “Amumwaange kumyeendo akumaanza mumuwaale anze amunshinzhe, awo mpweshi anokulila a kulumanya meno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Jesu mukumanizha wakaamba ati, “Mbaanji batambilwe pesi basalilwe mbashoonto.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani akupa mitelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maako 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luuka 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Bamane ba Faliisi bakaunka kuli Jesu mukumusola a mubuzho. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Bakatuma bashichiiya bakwe atomwe a Ba Helodi. “O Muii, tulizhi kwaamba uli muntu waamba zhanchobeni, kakutaaku akuyeyela bantu nchibayeeya. ono ulayisha kabotu bantu nzhila ya Leza yanchobeni. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Twaambile, ina wayeeya buti? Saa chili mu mulawo kwaaamba katupa mitelo kumwendelezhi munene waku Looma? Naa tutapi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Pesi Jesu wakazhiba mizeezo yabo, wakaamba ati, “Imwe nubashikupaupa amenso, nkambo nzhi mutekunsola? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Amutondezha maali ngumupa mitelo,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">bakamuletela ka koini, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Alimwi wakababuzha ati, “Nchiwa chabani ichi? Alimwi ndiina lyabani ili?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bakanviila ati, “Nzha Kaisala,” “Amupe zha Kaisala kuli Kaisala azhalo zha Leza kuli Leza.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Amane nibakanva bakakankamana. Amane bakamushiya a kuunka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani akubuka kuzwa ku bafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maako 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luuka 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Buzuba bweenka abalo Basadukki bakaza baamba ati, taaku kubuka kuzwa kubafu bakaza kuli Jesu amubuzho. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />Bakaamba ati, “O Muii,” Mozesi wakatwaambila ati, “Naa mukwanu musankwa wafa, amana washiya mukaintu katachite mwaana, musankwa mukwabo shikufa ulyelele kukwata mukamufu, kwaamba amuzhalile baana baitwa kwaamba mbamufu. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ono, kwakalinga bamukowa bali chiloba, munene wakakwata amana wafa katana kuzhala mwaana, amane mukwabo wakamukwata mukamufu mukaintu. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Chintu chomwi chakachitika alimwi kuli wabili a watatu kushikila ku wa chiloba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Kumamanino mukaintu wakafa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ono chiindi chakubuka kuzwa kubafu ulakuba mukaintu wabaani? Nkambo boonse bali chiloba bakamukwata.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Mulisowekele nkambo tamuzhi malembe naa nguzu zha Leza. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Baakubuka bafile, tabakakwati naa kukwatwa, balakuba mbuli ba ngele ku julu <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Pesi kumakani a kubuka kwa bafu, saa tamuna kubala Leza mbwaamba kuli ndimwe, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />‘Ndime Leza wa Abulahamu, a Leza wa Izeki a Leza wa Jakobo.’ Ngu Leza wa bantu bapona kutaashi bafile.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Mbunga niyakanva, yakakankamana kunjiisho yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulawo unene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maako 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luuka 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Bama Faliisi nibakanva kwaamba Jesu wabaumuzha ba Sadukki, bakalinga kubungene atomwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Umwi wabo muii wa mulawo, wakasunka Jesu a mubuzho. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“O muii, ino nguli mulawo unene a milawo ya Leza?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Jesu wakabanviila ati, “Yanda Leza wako amoyo wako oonse, a muuya wako oonse, a mizeezo yako yoonse.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Uyu ngu mulawo wakutaanguna alimwi unene. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Alimwi wabili uyandika ulimbuli nguyo, ‘Yanda shimukobonyoko bwenka mbuli mboliyanda.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Yoonse milawo ya Mozesi anjiishyo zhaba shinshimi mpuzhijanika a milawo iyi yobilo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mubuzho ali Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maako 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luuka 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Bama Faliisi nibakabungana atomwe, Jesu wakababuzha ati, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Ino mulayeeya buti ku makani a Mesiya? Ino ngu Mwana a nii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Bakakanviila ati, “Ngu Mwana Devedi,”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Jesu wakabuzha ati, “Ino nkambo nzhi anu, Devedi wakaamba ati, “Muuya wakamunjila ku mwiita ati ‘Mwami?’<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Mwami wakaamba ku Mwami wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Kkala kululyo lwangu, kushikila nkabike bashinkondonyoko kuunshi amampata ako.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Naa Devedi wakamwiita ati, ‘Mwami,’ ino Mesiya inga wababuti Mwana a Devedi alimwi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Taaku naba omwi wakamunviila mubuzho wakwe Jesu, alimwi kuzwila ku chiindi icho, taaku naba omwi wakainduluka kubuzha mubuzho uli onse alimwi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wabachenjezha bantu kujatikizha ba maii ba mulawo a bama Faliisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Maako 12.38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luuka 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Ono Jesu wakaambila mbunga ya bantu a bashichiiya bakwe ati, <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Bamai ba mulawo a ba Faliisi mbubakazumizhigwa kupandulula mulawo wa Mozesi. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ono mulyelele kuchilila akuchita zhoonse nzhibamwaambila, pesi mutachilili nzhibachita nkambo tabachiti nzhibakambauka <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Balanyamuzha bantu amawezo katundu ilemu, pesi balo balaalilwa kubagwasha kunyamuna nakuba kusebenzha kanwe komwe kubagwasha kunyamuna katuundu. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Balachita zhintu zhoonse kwaamba babonwe a bantu. Amulange balasama zhintu zhichite malembo abuleza ankumo akumaaza, azhisani zhilaafu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Balayanda kukkala azhuno zhabulemu mu sinagogo, alimwi amisena yabulemu kuma pobwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Balayanda kugwazhigwa cha bulemu mumasena akuuzhila a kwiitwa ati ‘Muii’ ku bantu. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Alimwi tamwelele kwiitwa ati, ‘Muii,’ nkambo noonse muli bantu bomwi alimwi mulichite boo muii omwi. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Alimwi mutaiti muntu naba omwi anyika ano ati, ‘Taata,’ nkambo mulichite boo Ishi wanu omwi ku julu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Nakuba kwiitwa ati, ‘Musololi’ nkambo musololi wanu ngu Mesiya. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Munene akati kanu ulyelele kuba muzhika wanu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Boonse abo balisupula balakucheshegwa alimwi boonse abo balicheesha balakusumpulwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakakalalila ba maii ba mulawo a ba Faliisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maako 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luuka 11.39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />“Mawe kuli ndimwi ba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi! imwe nobashi kuupaupa amenso! Mulajalila bwami bwaku Julu kumenso a bantu, Pesi imwe nubene tamuyandi kunjila mo na kuzumizha abo bayanda kujilamo. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />“Mawe kuli ndimwe nuba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi! Nuba shikuupaupa amenso! Nkambo mulabweza lubono lwabamukabafu a kubeja kupaila mipailo ilaamfu, ono mulakutambula bulumbu bunene bwakunyonyoka.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Mawe kuli ndimwi nuba maii ba mulawo a nuba ma Faliisi, noba shikuupaupa amenso! Mulenda a nyika a kuzubuka milonga kusandula muntu omwe, amane mwamusandula mulamupanga kuba zhindi zhobilo mbuli mwaana mushoonto waku gehena mbuli ndimwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Mawe kuli ndimwe nuba sololi ba boofu! Mulaamba ati, ‘Mfumwa ulumbila a tempele taaku nchichaamba, pesi ati mfumbwa ulumbila a ngolide yamu tempele ulichite mulandu ku chishomyo icho.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Imwe nuba sololi bayonzhi boofu! Nchili chinene, Ngolide naa tempele ipa ngolide ku salala? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Alimwi mulaamba ati, ‘Mfumbwa ulumbila a chipaililo, tachite mulandu, pesi ati mfumbwa ulumbila a chipo chili a chipaililo ulichite mulandu.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Imwe nubantu boofu! Nchili chinene, chiipo naa chipaililo chipa chipo kusalala? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Mfumbwa ulumbila a chipaililo, ulalumbila a zhoonse zhili achipaililo. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Alimwi mfumbwa ulumbila a tempele, ulalumbila aujanika mo alimwi, ukkala mumo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Alimwi mfumbwa ulumbila ku julu, walumbila a chuno cha Leza uyo ushiite mpao.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Mawe kuli ndimwe nuba ba maii ba mulawo a nuba ma Faliisi, nuba shikuupaupa amenso! nkambo mulapa kwakkumi kwa tununkilizho a koliyanda a galiki a papulika. Pesi mulasulaika makani anene a mulawo, mbuli mashimpe, a luzhalo a kushomeka. Izhi nzhizhelele kuchitwa kwakubula kusulaika zhakutaanguna. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Imwe nubasololi boofu! Mulagusha nzhinini mumunwina pesi mulamina Nkamela!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Mawe kuli ndimwe nuba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi, nuba shikuupaupa amenso! Mulasanzha nkapu a mbale asengwa, pesi mukati zhilizwile kuliyanda a bulyato. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Imwe nuba Faliisi boofu! Amutangune musanzhe nkapu a mbale mukati, kwaamba asengwe aalo alasalale.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Mawe kuli ndimwe ba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi, nuba shikuupaupa amenso! muli mbuli zhuumbwe zhituba, zhiboneka kabotu ansengwe pesi mukati zhili zwile mafuwa a bantu bafile. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Munzhila yeenka iyi, mulaboneka kusalala ansengwe ku bantu, pesi mukati mwanu mulizwile bushikuupaupa amenso abubiibi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu washinshima chisubulo chabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luuka 11.47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Mawe kuli ndimwi nuba maii ba mulawo aba Faliisi, nuba shikuupaupa amenso! Mulayaka zhumbwe zha bashinshimi akubamba kabotu zhumbwe zhababo bakapona bumii busalala. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Alimwi mulaamba ati iswe nitwakapona mu mazuba a kapona basshikale besu, niinga tatutoli lubazu mukutila malowa a bashinshimi. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ono mulazumina a kwaamba muli bana babo bakajaya bashinshimi! <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Kamuzumanana akumanizha zhakatalika bashikale banu! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />“Nonzoka imwe alimwi bana achipili! Ino mulaakuleya buti kuzwa ku gehena? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ono ndamwaambila kwaamba, ndamutumina bashinshimi a basongo aba maii, balo abo bamwi babo mulakubajaya a kubapenzha alimwi bamwi mulakubakwipa muzhipaililo akubatadanya kuzwa mu munzhi omwi a kuunka kumbi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Nkambo kaako bulowa bwabasalali boonse bwakatilwa anshi anyika, buli amitwi yanu, kutalikila kuli mululami Abelo akushikila kuli Zakaliya mwana Belekiya, walo uyo ngumwakajaya akati ka tempele a chipaililo. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Chanchobeni ndamwaambila kwaamba, zhintu zhoonse izhi zhilakuza ku musela uyu.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu walilila munzhi wa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luuka 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“O Jelusalema Jelusalema, wajaya bashinshimi a kubauma mabwe abo Leza mbakatumwa kuli ndiwe, zhiindi zhongaye zhindakalinga kuyanda kubika maanza angu oonse ku bantu bako, bwenka mbuli inkuku mbwifukatila twana twanjiyo, pesi imwe tamuna kunzumina ime. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Langa ono Ng'anda yanko yachaala mu matongo. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ono ndamwaabila, kuzwa ono tamukamboni alimwi ime, kushikila mukaambe ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 23:39">‘Leza aleleke uyo uza mu liina lya Mwami.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakaamba kunyonyolwa kwa tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Maako 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luuka 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Ono Jesu nakazwa mu tempele kaunka abalo bashichiiya bakwe mukumutondezha lubumbu lwa tempele. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Tee mwazhibona zhintu izhi zhoonse?” Nchanchobeni ndamwambila taaku libwe naliba lyomwi lishilikashaale a julu a libwe lyenzhinyina, onse alakusowelwa anshi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzhi a makatazho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maako 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luuka 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Mbuli Jesu mbwakalinga kushite a mulundu wa Oliva, bashichiiya bakwe bakaza kuli nguwe chakusishikizha. “Twambile, ino zhintu izhi zhoonse zhilakuchitika lili? Bakabuzha ati, “Nchitondezho nzhi ncheshi tukabone chakuza kwako a mamanino achiindi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Amuchenjele kwaamba muntu atamuchengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Nkambo bantu baanji balakuza mu liina lyangu, kabaamba ati, ‘Ndime Mesiya!’ alimwi balakuchenga bantu baanji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Mulakunva inkondo aimpuwo yankondo kulale a afaafi, pesi mutakatiji nkambo zhintu izhi zhilyelele kutaanguna kuchitika, pesi tazhambi kwaamba mamanino achiindi ashika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Chishi chilakubukila chishi nyina abwalo bwami bulakubukilana a bwami nyina. Alimwi kulakuba nzala a muzuzumo mu masena apuseene pusene. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Zhoonse izhi zhili mbuli matalikilo amachise a kuzhalwa kwa mwaana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Alimwi mulakupenzhengwa a kujaigwa, achishi chilakumusulaika a nkambo ka ndime. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ku chiindi icho bantu baanji balakusowekelwa lushomo lwabo a kuuzhana mulwabo bene, a kusulaikana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Alimwi kulakuza bashinshimi baanji beshi bakachenge bantu baanji <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Nkambo ka bubiibi bweshi bukavule, luyando lwa bantu baanji lulakutontola. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Pesi uyo onse ushi akajatishe kushikila kumamanino ulakufutulwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Alimwi Mulumbe Mubotu wabulelo bwa Leza ulakukambaukwa munyika yoonse mbuli kamboni wamashi onse amane mamanino achiindi alakushika.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisesemyo chinene chitijisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maako 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luuka 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Ono mwaakubona, chisesemyo chileta kumwaya, chakaambwa a mushinshimi Danyele, kachiinvi mu busena busalala, amuleke uyo ubala avinshe. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Abo boonse bali mu Judiya ababalikile mu malundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Onse uyo uli ajulu achiluli ataseluki akuunka mu Ng'andu kubweza chintu chili choonse <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Onse uli mu muunda atajoki kubweza chikobela chakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Mawe ku mukaintu ushi akajanike kamitile a ushi a kanokunyonsha ku chiindi icho! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Amupaile kwaamba kubalika kwanu kutakabi chiindi champeyo naa buzuba bwa Nsabata. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Nkambo ku chiindi icho kulakuba mapenzhi anene, atana kubako kuzwa chiindi nyika niyakalengwa kushikila sunu. Alimwi takukabi mapenzhi ali mbuli aya alimwi. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Leza natakachesha mazuba amapenzhi aya, nikwatakaba muntu naba omwi upuluka. Pesi nkambo ka bantu bakwe mbakasala wakafiimpya mazuba ayo.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />A chiindi icho, naa umwi akaambe ati, ‘langa, ngoyu Mesiya’ naa ‘ngolya’ mutakamuzumini. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Nkambo kulakuza ba Mesiya babeji, a bashinshimi babeji. balakuchita zhitondezho a zhintu zhikankamanisha kwaamba nakachikonzheka bakabeje a basale ba Leza. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Amunve! ono imwe ndamwaambila chiindi kachitana kushika.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Naa bantu bakamwaambile ati, ‘Amulange ngolya mu nga'anda, mutakaunki ko nakuba bakaambe ati, ‘Amulange ngolya uliyubile alya mutakabanvili. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Nkambo kuza kwa Mwana a Muntu kulakuba mbuli lulabo lumweka kuzwa kujwe kuunka kumbo.<verse eid="MAT 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Mfumbwa kuli mutunta nkukubungana makubi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuza kwa Mwana a Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maako 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luuka 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Peenka penka mu mazuba ayo, a kwiinda mapenzhi, lizuba lilakushiya, walo mwenzhi taukapi mumuni wanguyo, alimwi nyenyenzhi zhila kuloka kuzwa ku julu, alimwi nguzu zhaku julu zhilakuzungaana. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Amane chitondezho chilakuboneka chakuza kwa Mwana a Muntu ku julu chilakuboneka, amana bantu boonse ba munyika balakulila baakubona Mwana a Muntu kaza muma kumbi aku julu a bulemu a nguzu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Alimwi mwembo unene ulakunvika kulila amane ulakutuma ba ngeli bakwe muzhibaaka zhone akubunganya bantu bakwe basale kuzwa kumbazu zhone zhanyika.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiyo kuzwa ku mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maako 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luuka 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Ono amwiiye chiyo kuzwa ku mukuyu, misaampi yanguyo nitalika kusonsa mateu ashuuka inga mwazhiba kwaamba mainza ali afaafi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ono mwakuzhibona zhintu izhi kazhichitika, mulakuzhiba kwaamba chiindi chashika. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Kashimpe ndamwaambila musela uyu taukamani kushikila zhintu izhi zhoonse zhikachitike. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Julu anyika zhilakwiinda, pesi majwi angu takamani.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taaku uzhi buzuba a chiindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maako 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luuka 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Taaku naba omwi ubuzhi buzuba ubo nachiba chiindi. Nibaba ba ngeli tabazhi, naba Mwana a Muntu, pesi Taata eenke nguzhi. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Bweenka mbuli mbu chakalinga mu mazuba abana Nowa, akuza kwa Mwana a Muntu mbweshichikabe. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Mu mazuba chiindi muyoba kautana kuba, bantu bakalinga kulya a kunwa a kukwata a kukwatishana, kushikila chiindi Nowa nakanjila mu bwaato, <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />alimwi taaku nchibakalinga kuzhi chakalinga kuchitika, kushikila chiindi muyoba niwakaza akubatola boonse. Alimwi bweenka mbweshi chikabe chiindi Mwana a Muntu a kuza. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Ku chiindi icho basankwa bobilo kabasebenza mu muunda, amane umwi ulakubwezegwa pesi umwi ulakushaala. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Alimwi bamakaintu bobilo balakujanika kabagaya chakulya atomwi, pesi umwi ulakubwezegwa amane umwi ulakushaala.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Ono a mukkale akupakamana nkambo tamuzhi buzuba Mwami neshi a kaze. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Pesi ono amunvishe, mwiine Ng'anda nalikuzhi chiindi kabwalala naza, niinga ulakkala akupakamana kwaamba kabwalala atanjili mu ng'anda yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Andimwe ono kamukkala akulibambila lyoonse nkambo Mwana a Muntu ulakuza a chiindi nchimutayeyeli.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musebenzhi ushomeka a utashomeki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luuka 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Ino nguni musebenzhi ushomeka? alimwi Mwendelezhi musongo, ngwinga shimalelo wabika kulanganya ba sebenzhi akupa chakulya achiindi chibotu? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Nchibotu kumusebenzhi uyo chiindi shemalelo akwe najoka wamujana utachita nchamwaabila. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Kashimpe ndamwaambila, ulakumubika kwaamba ayendelezhe lubono lwa shemalelo akwe loonse. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Pesi naa kali musebezhi mubiibi, inga waamba mu moyo wakwe ati, shemalelo angu waunka mukukkala nkwakaunka teshi akaze kufambana, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />amane watalika kuuma basebenzhi bezhinyina akutalika kulya akunwa chakukolwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Pesi shimalelo wamusebenzhi uyu, ulakuza buzuba achiindi nchatamuyeyeli kwaamba inga waza <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Amane shimalelo wakwe ulakumutimbaulila zhimpanzha akumubika musebezhi wakwe akumusowela kubusena bwabashikupaupa amenso, kwalo uko nkweshi ba kanolila akulumanya meeno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kaba nakalindu bali kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />“Ono ku chiindi icho bwami bwa ku julu bulakuba mbuli bamakaintu bali kkumi, bakabweza malampi abo akuunka mukuchinga shibwiinga. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Bali bosanwe bakalinga bayozhi alimwi bali bosanwe bakalinga basongo <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Ono bayozhi taaku nibakabweza mafuta mumalampi abo aindilila. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Pesi basongo balo bakabweza malampi abo a mafuta akalikwindilila. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ono nkambo shibwiinga wakachelwa kuza, boonse bakatalika kufukula.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Ono akati kamashiku bakanva koolobezha kwa bantu, ‘Ngoyu shibwiinga! Kamuza mumuchinge!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Bamane boonse bana kalindu bakabuka akuyasha malampi abo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Amane bayozhi bakaamba ku basongo, ‘Amutupeko mafuta anu, malampi esu alazhima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />“Pesi basongo bakanviila ati, ‘Taaku mafuta akwaamba twaabane andimwe. Pesi kamuunka mukaule kumasambalilo nubeene.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ono kabachili munzhila mukuula mafuta, shibwiinga wakashika. Amane abo bakalikulibambile bakanjila anguwe mu pobwe lya bwiinga, umane mulyango wakajalwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />“Nikwakainda chiindi bakalinga baunka mukuula mafuta bakajoka akwaamba ati, ‘Mwami, Mwami! amutujalwile mulyango tunjile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />“Shibwiinga wakabanviila ati, ‘Kashimpe ndamwaabila! Nshimuzhi imwe.”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Abobo, Jesu mukumanizha wakabaambila ati, “Amukkale akupakamana nkambo tamuzhi buzuba naa chiindi.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaambyo kabasebenzhi botatwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luuka 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Ono, “Alimwi chila kuba mbuli muntu uunka a lweendo, wakaiita ba sebenzhi bakwe akubapa lubono lwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Wakutaanguna wakamupa maali masaka a ngolide ali osanwe alimwi umwi wakamupa maali masaka a ngolide ali obilo amane wamamanino wakamupa lisaka lya maali a ngolide lyomwi, wakabapa boonse kwendelana ambubachikonzha amane wakabweza lweendo lwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ono uyo wakapegwa masaka a maali a ngolide ali osanwe, wakaunka akwasebenzha amane wakajana mpindu ya maali masaka a ngolide ali osanwe aamwi. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Awalo uyo wakapegwa masaka a maali obilo a ngolide wakajana mpindu ya maali masaka obilo aamwi. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Pesi umwi musebenzhi wakapegwa lisaka lya maali lyomwi a ngolide, wakaunka washa chilindi amane wakavikila maali ashimalelo akwe.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ono nikwakainda chiindi chilaamfu, shimalelo wabo wakajoka amane wakabaita basebenzhi bakwe boonse kwaamba bamupandululile mbubakasebenzha maali. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Musebenzhi wakapegwa maali a masaka osanwe a ngolide wakaletalepo amwii masaka ali osanwe. Wakaamba ati, ‘O shimalelo angu,’ wakaampa masaka a maali a ngolide ali osanwe, ‘Langa, ndakapindula akujana pindu ya masaka ali osanwe aamwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Shimalelo akwe wakaamba ati, ‘Wachita kabotu o musebenzhi wangu ushomeka, ono nkambo washomeka muzhintu zhishoonto, ono ndakubika kwaamba wendelezhi zhintu zhiinji. Njila ukomane atomwe ashimalelo akw!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Awalo musebenzhi wakapegwa masaka a maali obilo a ngolide wakaza akwaamba ati, ‘O shimalelo angu, wakampa masaka a maali obilo a ngolide, pesi langa! ndakapindula akujaninapo maali masaka obilo amwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />“Shimalelo akwe wakaamba ati, ‘Wachita kabotu o musebenzhi wangu ushomeka, ono nkambo washomeka muzhintu zhishoonto, ono ndakubika kwaamba wendelezhe zhintu zhiinji. Njila ukomane atomwe ashimalelo ako!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Amane uyo musebenzhi wakapegwa lisaka lyomwi lya maali a ngolide wakaza akwaamba, ‘Ndalikuzhi kwaamba uli muntu mubiibi ulatebula mputana kumwaya, alimwi ulabuganya mputana kumwaya mbuto. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ndakatija, ono ndakaunka akulishila chilindi lisaka lya maali ako akwavikila. Langa! Maali ako ngaya.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />“Shimalelo akwe wakanviila ati, ‘O musebenzhi mubiibi mutolo, wakalikuzhi kwaamba ndatebula mputana kumwaya akubuganya mputana kumwaya mbuto? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Anu walikwelele kwabika maali angu mumanza abashipindu kwaamba ndajoka ndajana maali angu azhalana. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Amumunyange maali mwape kuli uyo uchite ali kkumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Alimwi uli oonse uchite kale ulakupegelwo azhimwi, alimwi ulakuba a zhintu zhiinji. Pesi uli onse utachite, akashoonto nkachite kalakubwezegwa kuli nguwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ono amumubweze mubibi uyu akumuwala ansengwe amunshinzhe, alo awo mpweshi anolila akulumanya meno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubeta lwamamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />“Chiindi Mwana a Muntu a kuza mubulemu bwakwe, a bangele boonse anguwe, ulakukkala achuno chakwe chabulemu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Alimwi bantu ba mishobo yoonse balakubungana kulinguwe, alimwi ulakwandanya bantu, bweenka mbuli mwembezhi mbwaandanya mbelele kuzwa kumpongo. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ulakubika mbelele kulyanza lyakwe lyakululyo amane mpongo ulakuzhibika kulumweshi. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Amana Mwami ulakwaambila bali kululyo lwakwe kwaamba, ‘Kamuza imwe nimulelekelwe a Taata, mubweze bulelo mbumwakabambilwa kuzwa kumatalikilo anyika. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Nkambo ndakalinga kunvile nzala pesi mwakampa chakulya, alimwi ndakalinga kunvile nyotwa mwakampa maanzhi akunwa, ndakalinga mweenzu mwakantambula. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Ndakalinga mantanda mwakansamika, nindakalinga mulwazhi mwakanswaya, a nindakalinga muntolongo mwakaza mukunswaya.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Amane basalali balakumunviila ati, ‘O Mwami ndilili nitwakakubona kofile nzala akukupa chakulya naa kukupa maanzhi chiindi niwakalikunvile nyotwa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ino ndilili nitwakakubona koli mweenzu alimwi akukutambula, naa niwakalinga mantanda akukusamika? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ino ndilili nitwakakubona koli mulwazhi naa koli muntolongo alimwi a kukuswaya? <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Amane Mwami ulakubanviila ati, ‘Kashimpe ndamwambila, kufumbwa nchimwakachitila baba bashoonto bakwesu mwakachitila ndime.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Amane ulakwaambila abo bali kulumwenshi kwaamba ati, kamuzwa kuli ndime imwe nimwakashinganishigwa, akuunka mu gehena walo uyo wakabambilwa Satani a bangele bakwe! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Nkambo ndakalinga kufile nzala pesi taaku nimwakampa chakulya alimwi ndakalinga kufile nyotwa taaku nimwakampa maanzhi. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Ndakalinga mweenzu taaku nimwakantambula alimwi nindakalinga mantanda taaku nimwakansamika, alimwi nindakalinga mulwazhi naa muntolongo taaku nimwakanswaya.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Amana balakumunviila ati, ‘Ndilili O Mwami nitwaakubona kofile nzala naa koli mweenzu naa koli mantanda naa koli mulwazhi naa muntolongo amana twabula kukugwasha?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Mwami ulakubanviila ati, ‘Kashimpe ndamwambila, kufumbwa nchimwakakaka kuchitila aba bashoonto bakwesu. Mwakakakila kuchitila ndime.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Amane balakutolwa ku gehena, pesi basalali blakuunka ku buumi butamani.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Jesu mbubakamukanza kumujaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maako 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luuka 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Jesu nakamanizha kuiisha zhintu izhi zhoonse, wakaambila bashichiiya bakwe ati, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Mbuli bweenka mbumuzhi kwaamba kwashaala mazuba obilo kwaamba Pasika ibe, ono awalo Mwana a Muntu ula kwaabwa kwaamba agagailwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Bapaizhi banene a bamaalu bakabungana ambali ku ng'anda ya mwami munene Kaifaasi, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />alimwi akupangana mbweshi bamujate Jesu chakusisikizha a kumujaya. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />“Ono bakaamba ati, tutakuchiti chiindi cha pobwe nkambo inga kwaba kunyongana akati ka bantu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakananikwa mafuta chiindi nakalinga ku Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maako 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ono chiindi Jesu nakalinga ku Betani mu ng'anda ya Saimoni shimankuntu, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Kwakashika mukaintu a mafuta aadula a nunkila kabotu a kutila Jesu kumutwi chiindi nakalinga kulya. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Chiindi bashichiiya nibakabona ichi, bakakalala akubuzha ati, “Nkambo nzhi wasowaila mafuta aya?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />“Mafuta aya nauzhigwa muulo unene a kupa maali ku bachete!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Jesu nakazhiba nchibakalinga kwaamba, wakabaambila ati, “Nkambo nzhi mulamupenzha uyu mukaintu? Walo wachita chintu chibotu kuli ndime. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Bantu Bachete mulanokuli ambabo lyoonse pesi ime teeshi munokuli andime lyoonse. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Nchachita kuntila mafuta amubili wangu, waubamba kwaamba nkazhikwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Kashimpe ndamwambila, mfumbwa kuli koonse nkweshi ukakambaukwe Mulumbe Mubotu munyika yoonse, achalo nchachita mukaintu uyu chilakwambwa mukuyeya nguye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi wakazumina kwaaba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maako 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luuka 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Alimwi umwi wabali kkumi abobilo wakalikwiitwa ati Judasi Isikalyoti, wakaunka ku bapaizhi banene <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />a kubuzha ati, “Ino mulampanzhi nda mwaaba Jesu kuli ndimwe?” Ono bakabala maali asiliva ali makkumi otatwe akumupa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Ono kuzwa chiindi icho Judasi wakalinga kulangaula chiindi chibotu chakumwaaba Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakalya Pasika abashichiiya bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maako 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luuka 22.7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mubuzuba bwakutanguna bwa Pasika ya chinkwa chitachite mimena, bashichiiya bakaza kuli Jesu a kumubuzha, “Nkuli nkuyanda kwaamba tukabambile Pasika kwaamba ulye?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Wakabanviila ati, “Kamuunka mu munzhi umwi mulajana muntu mumwaambile kwaamba ati, ‘Muii waamba ati, chiindi changu chili afaafi, ndanda kulya Pasika mu ng'anda yako atomwi a bashichiiya bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Alimwi bashichiiya bakachita bweenka Jesu mbwakabalailila a kubamba pasika.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Mangolezha nakaza, Jesu a bashichiya bakwe bali kkumi abobilo bakakaala anshi a kutalika kulya. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Alimwi nibakalinga kulya Jesu wakaamba ati, “Kashimpe ndamwaabila, akati kanu umwi wanu ulangaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bashichiiya nibakanva, bakausa a kutalika kumubuzha omwi a omwi ati, “Saa ndime O Mwami?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Eenka ngutokubwenga anguye mumbale ulakungaba. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana a Muntu ulakufa kwendelana a malembe bwaamba. Pesi mawe ku muntu uyo ushi a kaabe Mwana a Muntu! Chali kwiinda kubota natakazhalwa boo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Amana Judasi shikwaaba Jesu wakaamba ati, “Saa ndime O Muii? Jesu wakanviila ati, “Waamba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulalilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maako 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luuka 22.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ono nibakalinga kulya Jesu wakabweza chinkwa nakamana kupa kulumba a kuchikomauna amane wapa bashichiiya bakwe, wakaamba ati, “Amubweze mulye uyu mubili wangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Amane wakabweza nkaapu, alimwi nakamana kupa kulumba wakapa bashichiiya bakwe akwaamba ati, “Kamunwa noonse mu nkaapu umu,” <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />“Ubu mbubulowa bwangu bwachizuminano chipya bwakatikila baanji kwaamba zhinyonyono zhilekelelwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Ndamwambila, nshikanwi alimwi waiini wamichelo kushikila buzuba mbweshinkanwe waiini mupya mu bwami bwa Taata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Amane nibakamana kwiimba lwiimbo bakaunka ku mulundu wa Oliva.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakashinshima kwaamba Petulo ulakumutama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maako 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luuka 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Alimwi Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Mashiku eenka aya noonse mulambalika akunshiya neenka, nkambo kulilembelwe kwaamba ati, ‘Leza ulakujaya mweembezhi, amana mbelele zhilakupalangana.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Pesi ndakubushigwa ndakumutaangunina kuunka ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Petulo wakamunviila Jesu a kwaamba ati, “Nakuba boonse bakushiiya, ime nshikakushiyi!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Jesu wakaambila Petulo aati, “Chanchobeni ndakwaambila mashiku eenka aya mukombwe katana kulila, utokuntama zhiindi zhotatwe kwaamba tonzhi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Petulo wakanviila ati, “Nikuba kwaamba mfe andiwe teshinkutame!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Alimwi a bashichiiya bamwi bakaamba bweenka.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakapaila mumunda wa Getesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maako 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luuka 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Jesu wakaunka abashichiiya bakwe kubusena bwa Getesemani, alimwi wakakabaambila ati, “Amukkale ano ime ndaunka mukupaila ampela.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Wakabweza Petulo, a bana Zebediya, amana wakapenzhegwa akuusa mu moyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Amane wakabaambila ati, “Moyo wangu ulizwile kuusa kushika ku lufu. Amukkale ano akulangila andime.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ono nakeenda boo ashoonto kuunka kumpela, wakawa chakuvuntama a kupaila waamba ati, “Taata nakachikonzheka amugushe nkaapu iyi kuli ndime, pesi kutaashi kuyanda kwangu pesi kuyanda kwako.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ono nakajokela ku bashichiiya bakwe wakajana baloona. Wakabuzha Petulo ati, “Nkambo nzhi mwaalilwa kulangila andime kwaola boo lyomwi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />“Amulangile akukomba kwaamba mutanjili mu masunko. Moyo ulayandisha pesi mubili wabula nguzu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Amane wakaunka chiindi chabili akupaila ati, “Taata, natachikonzheki kwaamba nkaapu iyi igushigwe kuli ndime pesi njinwe, luyando lwako aluchitwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Nakajokela alimwi wakabajana bashichiiya bakwe baloona nkambo bakali kufile tulo.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Wakabashiiya akuunka mukupaila chiindi chatatu kaamba mazwi enka. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Amane wakajokela ku bashichiiya akubambila ati, “Saa muchoona akupumuna? Amulange! Chiindi chashika chakwaamba Mwana a Muntu aabwe mumaza abashizhibi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Amunyamuke tweende shikungaba ngoyu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu mbubakamujata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maako 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luuka 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Peenka penka kachibandika, awalo Judasi, umwi wabali kkumi abobilo, wakashika antomwi a imbunga ya bantu ya yakalinga kunyamwine mapanga ankooli. Mbunga iyi yakatumwa a mupaizhi munene, a bamaalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Ono shikumwaaba wakabaambila kwaamba ndamupa chitondezho chakwaamba ati, “Uyo ngweshi myonte ngunguwe, mumwaange!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Peenka awo Judasi wakaunka kuli Jesu akwaamba ati, “Lumuno lube andiwe O Muii,” amane wakamumyonta.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Jesu wakamunviila ati, “Ko chiita nchiweendela u mweenzuma.” Amana Jesu bakamujata. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Abobo umwi wabo wakali kwinvi afifi wagusha panga lyakwe, akuzutula litwi lyamusebenzhi wamupaizhi munene. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Jesu wakamwaambila ati, “Jola panga lyako mpulikkala,” “Nkambo oonse uyo ubelesha panga ulakujaigwa apanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Saa ulayeya kwaamba inga nchilomba Taata kwaamba antumine ikkumi a yobilo ya nkamu ya bashikalumaamba kwaamba bangwashe? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Pesi ina ono mbuti Malembe mbwiinga azuzikizhigwa, aamba kwaamba chilyelele kuchitika munzhila iyi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Chiindi icho Jesu wakaambila mbunga ya bantu ati, “Saa ntokusololela nkamu yabazangi, cha kwaamba mwaza mukunjata amapanga ankooli? Mazuba oonse ndakalinga andimwe kanjiisha mu tempele, abobo taaku nimwakanjata. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Pesi zhoonse izhi zhachitika kwaamba Malembe abashinshimi azuzikizhigwe.” Amana bashichiiya boonse bakamubalika akupalangana.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatolegwa ku nkuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maako 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luuka 22.54-55</ref>; 63-71; Joni 18.13–14; 19-24)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Abo bakajata Jesu bakamutola kuli Kaifasi mupaizhi munene, uko kwakalinga kubungene ba maii ba mulawo aba maalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Pesi Petulo wakamuchilila alaamfu, amana wakanjila mu lubanza lwa ng'anda yamu Paizhi Munene. Wakakkala antomwi abalindilili kulindila cheshi chichtike. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ba Paizhi banene alimwi ankuta yoonse yakali kulangaula twaambo twakumutamikizha Jesu kwaamba ajaigwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Pesi tabana kumujanina kaambo nakuba kwaamba kwakaza bantu baanji bakalikumutamikizha twaambo, kumamanino kwakaza bantu bobilo <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />a kwaamba ati, “Uyu muntu wakaamba ati, “Ndakonzha kumwaya ng'anda ya Leza a kwiyaka mu mazuba otatwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mupaizhi Munene wakanyamuka akwaambila Jesu ati, “Saa tochite bwinguzhi kutwaambo utu ntubato kwaamba?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Pesi Jesu wakaumuna boo. Mupaizhi munene wakaambila Jesu ati, “Ndakulomba mu liina lya Leza upona, twaambile saa ndiwe Mesiya, Mwana Leza.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Jesu wakanviila ati, “Waamba. Pesi ndamwambila noonse, kutalikila chiindi ichi ono mulakubona Mwana a Muntu kashite ku lyaanza lyalulyo lya ooyo Shinguzu alimwi kaza mu makumbi a ku julu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Nakanva ichi mupaizhi munene, wakakwamuna chisani chakwe akwaamba ati, “Waamba chakusampaula Leza! Ino mbukamboni nzhi mbutuyanda alimwi! mwalinvila mbwasapaula Leza <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Mwayeeya buti?” Bakanviila ati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">“Wazulwa alimwi ulyelele kufa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Amane bakamushipila mate akumuuma, bamwi bakamuuma mapaka. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Alimwi bakaamba ati, “Koshinshima Mesiya, nguni wakuuma!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo wakamukaka Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maako 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luuka 22.56-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ono chiindi Petulo nakalinga kushite asengwe mu lubaanza lwa tempele, mushimbi musebenzhi wakaamba kuli nguwe ati, “Andiwe wakalinga a Jesu waku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Pesi Petulo wakakaka chantangalala akwaamba ati, “Nshizhi nchutokwaamba.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Amane wakaunka kumanjililo a lubaanza lwa tempele uko nkwakajana aumwi musebenzhi mushimbi, wakaambila bantu kwaamba ati, “Uyu walinga a Jesu waku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Pesi Petulo alimwi wakakaka akulumbila ati, “Nshimuzhi muntu uyo ngutokwaamba!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Nikwakainda kaindi kashoonto, bantu bakalinga kuinvi bakaunka kuli Petulo akwaamba ati, “Nchanchobeni ndiwe omwi wabo,” bakaamba ati, “Atala azhoonse mbuaamba mbubukuzubulula!”<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Amane Petulo wakaamba ati, “Chanchobeni ndalumbila nshimuzhi uyu muntu ngumutokwaamba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">peenka penka nakamana kukaka mukombwe wakalila. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Amane Petulo wakayeya mazwi ngakamwambila Jesu ati, “Mukombwe katana kulila ulankaka zhiindi zhotatwe kwaamba ntonzhi.” Amane Petulo wakaunka ansengwe akulila maningi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatolwa kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maako 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luuka 23.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ono kuseni seni boonse bapaizhi banene aba maalu bakapangana bwaku mujaya Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bakamwanga a kumutola kuli Pilato mwendelezhi wachi Looma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulyangilila kwa Judasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18">Milimo 1.18</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 1:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ono Judasi wakazhiba, kwaamba Jesu wapegwa mulandu wakujaigwa, wakasanduka akujola maali asiliva ali makkumi otatwe ku bapaizhi a bamaalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Wakaamba ati, “Ndabisha kwaaba muntu utachite mulandu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Bakanviila ati “Ino chilichite pindu nzhi icho kuli ndiswe?” nchiindi chako icho!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Judasi wakasowa maali anshi mu tempele akuzwa waunka mukulishina.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Amane bapaizhi banene bakabweza maali asiliva akwaamba ati, “Tachili mu mulawo kwaamba tubike maali aya muchibikilo nkambo maali abulowa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ono nibakamana kuzuminizhana maali bakauula muunda wamubumbi kwaamba kabazhikilako bantu beenzu. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Nkukambo ako ulaiitwa Muunda wa Bulowa kushikila sunu.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Icho chakaambwa amushinshimi Jelemiya chakazuzikizhigwa, “Bakabweza maali asiliva makkumi otatwe, mbuli mbubakazuminizhana a bantu baku Izilaili, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />alimwi maali bakaasebenzha kuula Muunda wamubumbi mbuli Leza mbwakandailila.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato wakabuzha Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maako 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luuka 23.3-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Bakaimika Jesu kumpela lya mwendelezhi Pilato waku Looma, amane mwendelezhi wakamubuzha ati, “Saa ndiwe Mwami wa ba Juuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Jesu wakanviila ati, “Waamba,” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Pesi chiindi bapaizhi aba maalu nibakamutamikizha twaambo akumubuzha, Jesu taaku nakanviila.<verse eid="MAT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Amane Pilato wakamubuzha kwaamba ati, “Saa tonviile twaambo ntubatokwaamba ali ndiwe?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Pesi Jesu taaku nakanviila lizwi naliba lyomwi, amane mwendelezhi wakakankamana.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu a Banabbasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maako 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luuka 23.13-25</ref>; Joni 18.39-19.16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Ono chakalinga nchilengwa kwaamba naa pasika yashika, mwendelezhi wakali kwangulula mwaange omwi ngubakasala bantu. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kuchindi icho kwakalinga mwange wakali kuzhibikilwe maningi Banabbasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ono mbunga ya bantu niyakabungana Pilato wakaibuzha ati, “Nguni ngumuyanda kwaamba mwangulwile? Banabbasi naa Jesu Mesiya?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Wakazhiba kwaamba bakapa Jesu mu maanza akwe nkambo kamunyono. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Mbuli Pilato mbwakalinga kushite a chuuno chabubeteshi, mukaintu wakwe wakatuma mulumbe kwaamba, “Utamuchiti chili choonse muntu uyo nkambo tachite mulandu, mashiku muchiloto ndapengana maningi nkambo kanguwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Pesi bapaizhi banene aba maalu bakakombelezha mbunga ya bantu kwaamba ilombe Banabbasi kwangululwa amane Jesu walo ajaigwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pesi Pilato wakabuzha mbunga ya bantu ati, “Nguni ngumuyanda akati ka bantu bobilo kwaamba mwangulwile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Bakanviila ati, “Banabbasi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Amane Pilato wakababuzha ati, “Ino ndachita buti a Jesu Mesiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Boonse bakanviila ati, “Agagailwe!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pesi Pilato wakabuzha ati, “Ino mulandu nzhi ngwa chita?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Bamane boonse bakaoolobezha akwaamba ati, “Agagailwe!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakapegwa mulandu wakujaigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilato nakabona kwaamba taaku chishi chichitike, kunze kwakuleta kunyongana, wakabweza maanzhi a kusamba kumaanza kumpela kwa mbunga ya bantu akwaamba ati, “Nshichite mulandu ku bulowa bwa muntu uyu,” kamuchita nchimuyanda nubene!” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Mbunga yoonse ya bantu yakanviila kwaamba ati, “Bulowa bwakwe bube alindiswe a bana besu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Amane Pilato wakaangulula Banabbasi, alimwi Jesu nakamana kukwipwa wakamwaaba kwaamba agagailwe achichingano.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bashikalumamba bakamusampaula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16">Maako 15.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Bashikalumamba ba Pilato bakatola Jesu mulubaanza lwa ng'anda yamwendelezhi, bakaita bashikalumamba benzhinyina boonse bakalingako. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bakamuuma akumusamika chisani chisalala, <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />bakapanga mushini wamanva akumubika kumutwi Jesu alimwi bakamubika kasamu mulyanza lyakwe lyalulyo akufungama kumpela lyakwe akutalika kumusabauzha, “Pona lyoonse O Mwami waba Juuda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bakamushipila mate a kubweza kasamu a kumuuma ku mutwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Alimwi nibakamana kumusampaula, bakamufuula chikobela amana bamusamika zhisani zhakwe. Amana bakamutola mukumugagaila achichingano.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakagagailwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maako 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luuka 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Mbuli mbubakali kuzwa, bakaswanganya musankwa wakalikuzwa ku Sailini Saimoni, amane bashikalumamba bakamushinikizha musankwa kunyamuna chichingano cha Jeau. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ono bakashika kubusena bwiitwa ati Gologota, chaamba ati, “Busena bwa chifuwa chakumutwi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Bamane bakamupa Jesu waiini wakalinga kusangene a indulwe, pesi nakaunva mbuwakalikulula wakaka ku unwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Nibakamana kumugagaila achinchingano bakakwamuna chinsani chakwe bakachabana akuminao nsolo. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Amane bakakkala anshi akutalika kwebela Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ono a julu a mutwi wakwe bakabika chitondezho chamalembe chakalinga kwaamba ati, “uyu ngu Mwami wama Juuda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Amane tupoondo tobilo twakagagailwa atomwi a Jesu, komwi kulyanza lyakululyo alimwi kamwi kulyanza lya kulumwenshi.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Ono bantu bakalinga kwiinda bakalinga kupukumuna mitwi yabo akutukana Jesu, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />alimwi akwaamba ati, “Iwewakalinga kwaamba ati ulakonzha kamwaya tempele akwiyaka mu mazuba otatwe, “Lifutule umwiine nauli Mwana a Leza, alimwi useluke achinchingano.”<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Munzhila yeenka abalo bapaizhi banene aba maii ba mulawo atomwi aba maalu bakamusampaula Jesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Wakafutula bamwi, pesi takonzhi kulifutula! Tee ngu Mwami wa Izilaili? kaaliselusha kuzwa achinchingano amana tulashoma muli nguwe! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ulashoma muli Leza amuleke Leza a mufutule naa ulamuyanda, nkambo wakaamba ati, ngu Mwaana a Leza!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ono munzhila yeenka atwalo tupoondo ntubakagagailwa atomwi twakamutukana.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufu lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maako 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44">Luuka 23.44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Chiindi cha malumwi (12 koloko) chishi choonse chakavumbwa amushinzhe kwa maola otatwe (3 koloko). <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Kwamaoola otatwe chiindi chamalumwi Jesu wakalila chakoolobezha, Eli, Eli lama sabakatani?” chaamba ati “Leza wangu, Leza wangu, Leza wangu ino wanshilanzhi?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ono bamwi bantu bakalinga kwinvi nibakanva, bakaamba ati, “Ulaita Elija.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Peenka penka umwi wabo wakabalika wabweza nsinsa, wanyika mu waiini usasile, waitunga kukasako kalaamfu, akumupa kwaamba anwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ono bamwi bantu bakaamba ati, “Amulindile, tubone naa ulaza mukumuvuna Elija.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Jesu alimwi wakalila alizwi lyakoolobezha amane wakafa. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />A chiindi icho chisani cha mu tempele chakakwamuka muzhipanzha zhobilo kutalikila ajulu kushika anshi, nyika ayalo yakazungana amana mabwe akandaana <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />alimwi zhuumbwe zhakajaluka amana mibili ya bantu basalala baanji yakabushigwa kuzwa ku bafu. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bakazhishiya zhuumbwe Jesu nakamana kubuka kuzwa kubafu, bakaunka mu munzhi Usalala alimwi akulitondezha kubantu baanji.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ono munene wabashikalumamba alimwi ababo mbakalikulindilila Jesu anguwe, bakabona muzuzumo alimwi azhoonse zhakachitika, bakatija alimwi akwaamba, “Nchachobeni wakalinga Mwaana Leza!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Kwakalinga bamakaintu baanji bakalinga kulangilila alaamfu, bakalinga kuchilila Jesu kuzwa Galilaya bakalinga kumugwashilizha nzhakalinga kuyanda. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ono akati kabo kwakalinga Maliya waku Magadalena, a Maliya banyina Jemusi a Josefa a muka Zebediya.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzhikwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maako 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luuka 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ono chiindi cha ku mangolezha, kwakaza musankwa muvubi kuzwa ku Alimataya Josefa, walo uyo wakalinga shichiiya wa Jesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Wakaunka kuli Pilato akulomba mubili wa Jesu. Amane Pilato wakamuzumizha. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Josefa wakaubweza mubili wa Jesu a kuvungaila muchisani chituba, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />a kuubika mu chuumbwe chakwe chipya, chalo nchakakolola libwe. Amane wakakunkulusha libwe linene washinka ku mulyango wa chuumbwe akuunka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Maliya Magadalena a Maliya umwi bakalinga kushite kulubazu lumwi lwa chuumbwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balindilizhi kuchuumbwe cha Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ono buzuba bwakachilila bwakalinga bwakulibambila, bapaizhi banene a bama Faliise bakaunka kuli Pilato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Akwaamba ati, “O Muii, “Tulayeeya kwaamba mubeshi ulya kachipona wakaamba ati, ‘Kwakwiinda mazuba otatwe ndakubuka alimwi.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ono kopa malailile kwaamba chuumbwe chakwe chilindililwe kushikila buzuba bwatatwu. Nkambo bashichiiya bakwe inga baakuza akwibba mubili wakwe amane akwaambila bantu ati Jesu wabushigwa kuzwa ku bafu. Nkambo uku kubeja kulakwiinda kwakutaanguna.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilato wakaamba ati, “Amubweze mulindi eshi alindilile chumbwe. “Amunke, mukachilindilile chuumbwe bweenka mbuli mbumuzhi bwakuchita.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Amana bakaunka ku chuumbwe bashinka libwe amana bakashiya shikulindilila.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kubuka kwa Jesu kuzwa kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maako 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luuka 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ono Nsabata niyakainda, buzuba bwakutaanguna Maliya waku Magadalena a Maliya umwi bakaunka mukulanga ku chuumbwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Kwakaba muzuzumo unene wanyika nkambo mungile wa Mwami wakaseluka anshi kuzwa ku julu, akukunkulusha libwe ku mulyango wachuumbwe amane wakakalawo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Wakaboneka mbuli kalabo alimwi zhisani zhakwe zhakalinga kutuba buu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Balindi bakatija, amane bakaba mbuli bantu bafile. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Pesi mungele wakaambila ba makaintu ati, “Mutatiji nkambo ndizhi kwaamba mutokulangaula Jesu wakagagailwa achichingano. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Taako kuno, wabuka bweenke mbuli mbwakaamba. Kamuza mubone mpalinga kuleede. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ono kamuunka kufambana mwaambile bashichiiya bakwe ati. ‘Wabuka kuzwa kubafu alimwi waunka kumpela lyanu ku Galilaya, uko mulamubona, ono ndamwambila.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Ono ba makaintu bakabalika kuzwa ku chuumbwe chakutija pesi kabakomene, bakaunka akwaambila bashichiiya bakwe.<verse eid="MAT 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Peenka penka Jesu wakabaswanganya amane wakaamba ati, “lumuno lube andimwe.” Amane bakaza kuli nguwe akumujata kumyeendo akumukomba. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Amane Jesu wakabaambila ati, “Mutatiji, kamunka alimwi mukabaambile bamakwesu kwaamba waunke ku Galilaya, uko balakumbona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaamba kwabalindilizhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ono mbuli bamakaintu mbubakalikunka, bamwi balindizhi bakaunka mumunzhi akwaambila bapaizhi banen zhoonse zhakachitika. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bapaizhi banene nibakaswangana atomwi aba maalu bakapanga muzezo wakupa maali aanji ku balindizhi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Alimwi wakaamba ati, “Mukabaambile ati bashichiiya bakwe baza mashiku alimwi bawibba mubili iswe katoona. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Naa mwendelezhi munene anve makani aya, tulamwimikanina imwe kwaamba tamuchite mulandu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Amane balindi bakabweza maali akuchita nchibakaambilwa, makani aya akaambwa koonse aba Juuda kushikila sunu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu wakatuma bashichiiya bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maako 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luuka 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Ono bashichiiya bali kkumi aomwi bakaunka ku Galilaya ku mulundu Jesu nkwakabaambila kuunka. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Nibakamubona bakamukomba pesi bamwi taaku bakashoma. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Ono Jesu wakaza kuli mbabo akwaamba ati, “Nguzu zhoonse zha ku julu a zha anshi zhapengwa kuli ndime. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kamuunka ono mupange bashichiiya munyika yoonse, mubabbizhe mu liina lya Taata a lya Mwaana a lya Muuya Usalala, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />alimwi mubaiishe kuchilila zhoonse nzhinda kamulailila. Amulange ndanokuli andimwe lyoonse kushikila kumamanino anyika.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>